    },
    "Estimate. Remaining time respects speed is on, so each episode is divided by that podcast’s playback speed, or Default speed, never below 0.5. This is not the live session rate and not Volume boost. The Favorites bar is the visible list after the podcast filter, search, and sort. Sort changes order only. Played episodes that are not currently playing count as zero. It is not the full Favorites catalog behind Clear favorites, Add all to queue, Add all unplayed to queue, Mark all as played, Mark all as unplayed, Archive all, Play random, Copy favorites, or Share favorites, and not the Home Favorites preview. Unknown durations are left out and no time is invented. The episode that is playing uses the live position, but the divisor stays the podcast or default speed. This is not the All Episodes remaining bar, the Queue remaining bar, the mini player, or Lock Screen. It does not play, download, or mark episodes played.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
