      "comment": "VoiceOver hint for the History remaining bar when Remaining time respects speed is off."
    },
    "Estimate. Remaining time respects speed is on, so each episode is divided by that podcast’s playback speed, or Default speed, never below 0.5. This is not the live session rate and not Volume boost. The Downloads bar is the visible list after the played-status chip, podcast filter, search, and sort. Sort changes order only. Played episodes that are not currently playing count as zero. It is not the full offline Downloads catalog behind the tab badge, Play random, Add all to queue, Add all unplayed to queue, Mark all as played, Mark all as unplayed, Archive all, Cancel all downloads, Delete played downloads, Delete all downloads, Copy downloads, or Share downloads, and not the Home Downloads preview. Unknown durations are left out and no time is invented. The episode that is playing uses the live position, but the divisor stays the podcast or default speed. This is not the History remaining bar, the Favorites remaining bar, the All Episodes remaining bar, the Queue remaining bar, the Inbox remaining bar, the Subscriptions unplayed remaining bar, a Home preview remaining bar, the mini player, or Lock Screen. It does not play, download, or mark episodes played.": {
