        }
      },
      "comment": "VoiceOver hint for the Library search remaining bar when Remaining time respects speed is on."
    },
    "Wall-clock remaining. Remaining time respects speed is off, so playback speed does not change this total. The Library search bar sums matching episode hits only: episodes across subscriptions whose title, description, episode private note, or bookmark note matches the query. Podcast hits are not included, and this is not the full library or the Inbox list. It does not search chapters or transcripts. Played episodes that are not currently playing count as zero. Unknown durations are left out and no time is invented. The episode that is playing uses the live position. This is not the Feed remaining bar, the Archived remaining bar, the Downloads remaining bar, the History remaining bar, the Favorites remaining bar, the All Episodes remaining bar, the Queue remaining bar, the Inbox remaining bar, the Subscriptions unplayed remaining bar, a Home preview remaining bar, the mini player, or Lock Screen. It does not play, download, or mark episodes played.": {
