    "Approximate: played episodes use lastPlayedAt (else updatedAt) and saved duration from playback.json — same limits as Statistics. Does not count rewinds, playback speed, or re-listens. Time range follows the device calendar; stamps are episode-level, not per-session.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Approximate: played episodes use lastPlayedAt (else updatedAt) and saved duration from playback.json — same limits as Statistics. Does not count rewinds, playback speed, or re-listens. Time range follows the device calendar; stamps are episode-level, not per-session."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Näherung: Gehörte Episoden nutzen lastPlayedAt (sonst updatedAt) und gespeicherte Dauer aus playback.json — gleiche Grenzen wie Statistiken. Zählt keine Rückspulungen, Wiedergabegeschwindigkeit oder erneutes Hören. Zeitraum folgt dem Gerätekalender; Zeitstempel sind episodenbezogen, keine Sitzungen."
          }
        }
