    "Remote chapters URL from the feed. The in-app chapter list still uses Podlove Simple Chapters, lazily fetched Podcast Index JSON when the Full Player opens, or local media-file tags — URL actions only open, copy, or share this URL; when present, the separate type actions copy or share the exact feed-provided caption.": {
