    "Appends %lld unplayed, non-archived favorite episode(s) to the end of the queue (newest favorited first). Already queued, played, and archived episodes are skipped. Uses the full Favorites catalog (same as Clear favorites), not the podcast, search, or sort filter. Queue lock does not block enqueue. Distinct from Add all to queue, which also includes played and archived episodes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
