          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kein Schwellwert eingegeben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mark as played when leaving or stopping within this many seconds of the end (AntennaPod smart mark). Presets Off/15/30/60/120/300/600 plus Custom… (1–600 seconds). Off (0) = only on natural end or explicit mark — not near-end scrub. Default 30. Seconds remaining only — not a percent threshold.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mark as played when leaving or stopping within this many seconds of the end (AntennaPod smart mark). Presets Off/15/30/60/120/300/600 plus Custom… (1–600 seconds). Off (0) = only on natural end or explicit mark — not near-end scrub. Default 30. Seconds remaining only — not a percent threshold."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als gehört markieren, wenn beim Verlassen oder Stoppen weniger als diese Sekunden Restzeit bleiben (AntennaPod Smart Mark). Presets Aus/15/30/60/120/300/600 plus Benutzerdefiniert… (1–600 Sekunden). Aus (0) = nur bei natürlichem Ende oder manuell — nicht bei Scrub nahe dem Ende. Standard 30. Nur Restsekunden — kein Prozent-Schwellwert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete after playing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete after playing"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach dem Abspielen löschen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follows Settings → Delete episode after playing (currently %@). Favorites still keep their offline files. Defers while that local file is the active player item.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follows Settings → Delete episode after playing (currently %@). Favorites still keep their offline files. Defers while that local file is the active player item."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folgt Einstellungen → Episode nach dem Abspielen löschen (aktuell %@). Favoriten behalten ihre Offline-Dateien. Verschiebt das Löschen, solange diese lokale Datei das aktive Player-Element ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never auto-delete this podcast’s offline files after playing, even when the global toggle is on. Manual Delete download still works.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Never auto-delete this podcast’s offline files after playing, even when the global toggle is on. Manual Delete download still works."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Löscht Offline-Dateien dieses Podcasts nach dem Abspielen nie automatisch — auch wenn der globale Schalter an ist. Manuelles Download löschen funktioniert weiter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete episode after playing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete episode after playing"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Episode nach dem Abspielen löschen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an episode is marked played (manual or when playback finishes), its offline file is deleted via DownloadService. The episode row and played status stay. Skips while that local file is still the active player item, and skips favorited / starred episodes. Per-podcast Feed settings can override with Always / Never.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When an episode is marked played (manual or when playback finishes), its offline file is deleted via DownloadService. The episode row and played status stay. Skips while that local file is still the active player item, and skips favorited / starred episodes. Per-podcast Feed settings can override with Always / Never."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn eine Episode als gehört markiert wird (manuell oder nach Wiedergabeende), wird die Offline-Datei über DownloadService gelöscht. Episodenzeile und Gehört-Status bleiben. Überspringt, solange diese lokale Datei noch das aktive Player-Element ist, und überspringt favorisierte / mit Stern markierte Episoden. Per-Podcast-Feed-Einstellungen können mit Immer / Nie überschreiben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, offline files are removed after an episode is marked played. Episode metadata and played status are kept. Per-podcast Feed settings can still Always delete for one feed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, offline files are removed after an episode is marked played. Episode metadata and played status are kept. Per-podcast Feed settings can still Always delete for one feed."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, werden Offline-Dateien entfernt, nachdem eine Episode als gehört markiert wurde. Episoden-Metadaten und Gehört-Status bleiben. Per-Podcast-Feed-Einstellungen können für einen Feed weiterhin Immer löschen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
