    "When on, marking an episode played clears its saved playback position to 0 (resume from start later). When off, the position is kept so Mark unplayed can resume. Applies to manual mark, mark-all, smart mark, and natural end. Default on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, marking an episode played clears its saved playback position to 0 (resume from start later). When off, the position is kept so Mark unplayed can resume. Applies to manual mark, mark-all, smart mark, and natural end. Default on."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, setzt „Als gehört markieren“ die gespeicherte Wiedergabeposition auf 0 (später von vorn). Wenn aus, bleibt die Position, damit „Als ungehört“ fortsetzen kann. Gilt für manuell, Alle markieren, Smart Mark und natürliches Ende. Standard an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
