        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Max. heruntergeladene Episoden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When over the episode count, played downloads that are not favorited and not queued are deleted first (oldest file first), then unplayed non-favorite non-queued (LRU). Favorites and queued episodes are never auto-deleted by this cap. Runs after each successful download, when opening Settings, and on launch. Separate from the Max storage byte budget.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When over the episode count, played downloads that are not favorited and not queued are deleted first (oldest file first), then unplayed non-favorite non-queued (LRU). Favorites and queued episodes are never auto-deleted by this cap. Runs after each successful download, when opening Settings, and on launch. Separate from the Max storage byte budget."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bei Überschreiten der Episodenanzahl werden zuerst gehörte Downloads gelöscht, die weder Favorit noch in der Warteschlange sind (älteste Datei zuerst), danach ungehörte Nicht-Favoriten außerhalb der Warteschlange (LRU). Favoriten und Warteschlangen-Episoden werden durch dieses Limit nie automatisch gelöscht. Läuft nach jedem erfolgreichen Download, beim Öffnen der Einstellungen und beim Start. Getrennt vom Max.-Speicher-Byte-Budget."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "25 episodes": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "25 episodes"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "25 Episoden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, finishing an episode auto-plays the next Queue item only — not the next episode of the same podcast. Default on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, finishing an episode auto-plays the next Queue item only — not the next episode of the same podcast. Default on."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, spielt das Beenden einer Episode nur den nächsten Warteschlangen-Eintrag — nicht die nächste Episode desselben Podcasts. Standard an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, finishing an episode auto-plays the next item from the Queue only (not the next episode of the same podcast). When off, episode end still marks played / saves progress but does not advance. End-of-episode sleep timer always stops without advancing. Default on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, finishing an episode auto-plays the next item from the Queue only (not the next episode of the same podcast). When off, episode end still marks played / saves progress but does not advance. End-of-episode sleep timer always stops without advancing. Default on."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, startet nach Ende einer Episode automatisch den nächsten Eintrag aus der Warteschlange (nicht die nächste Episode desselben Podcasts). Wenn aus, wird die Episode weiterhin als gehört markiert / Fortschritt gespeichert, aber nicht weitergeschaltet. Der Sleep-Timer „Ende der Episode“ stoppt weiterhin ohne Weiterleitung. Standard an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
