    "Opens Files to pick a folder of audio files. Creates a local subscription — no RSS and no network.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens Files to pick a folder of audio files. Creates a local subscription — no RSS and no network."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet Dateien, um einen Ordner mit Audiodateien zu wählen. Erstellt ein lokales Abo — kein RSS und kein Netzwerk."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "AddFeed Folder choose a11y hint"
    },
    "Beta: pick a folder of audio files (%@). Creates a synthetic subscription from files in that folder only (not subfolders) — no RSS, no network refresh, no Podcasting 2.0 / iTunes tags. Access is kept via a security-scoped bookmark; unsubscribe releases it. Refresh / Rescan re-reads the folder. Local folder podcasts are omitted from OPML, HTML export, and gpodder sync.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beta: pick a folder of audio files (%@). Creates a synthetic subscription from files in that folder only (not subfolders) — no RSS, no network refresh, no Podcasting 2.0 / iTunes tags. Access is kept via a security-scoped bookmark; unsubscribe releases it. Refresh / Rescan re-reads the folder. Local folder podcasts are omitted from OPML, HTML export, and gpodder sync."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beta: Wähle einen Ordner mit Audiodateien (%@). Erstellt ein synthetisches Abo nur aus Dateien in diesem Ordner (keine Unterordner) — kein RSS, keine Netzwerk-Aktualisierung, keine Podcasting-2.0-/iTunes-Tags. Zugriff bleibt über ein security-scoped Bookmark; Abo beenden gibt ihn frei. Aktualisieren / Neu scannen liest den Ordner erneut. Lokale Ordner-Podcasts fehlen in OPML, HTML-Export und gpodder-Sync."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "AddFeed Folder footer (formats)"
    },
    "What you get": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you get"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was du bekommst"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "AddFeed Folder honesty"
    },
    "Episodes = audio files in the folder. Play works offline from the file path. Empty folders are allowed — add files later, then Rescan.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Episodes = audio files in the folder. Play works offline from the file path. Empty folders are allowed — add files later, then Rescan."
