    },
    "Subscriptions only (beta — not full sync): Synced = http(s) podcast feed URLs (pull missing + push local not on server). Merge is additive — remote removes do not unsubscribe local feeds. Password in Keychain (never plaintext Settings/backup). Not synced (local-only): episode actions (play/download/position), queue, favorites, bookmarks, tags, downloads, local folder feeds, playback progress, archive, inbox. Last sync status and errors stay visible here. Default host https://gpodder.net (editable).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subscriptions only (beta — not full sync): Synced = http(s) podcast feed URLs (pull missing + push local not on server). Merge is additive — remote removes do not unsubscribe local feeds. Password in Keychain (never plaintext Settings/backup). Not synced (local-only): episode actions (play/download/position), queue, favorites, bookmarks, tags, downloads, local folder feeds, playback progress, archive, inbox. Last sync status and errors stay visible here. Default host https://gpodder.net (editable)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur Abonnements (Beta — kein voller Sync): Synchronisiert = http(s)-Podcast-Feed-URLs (fehlende holen + lokale pushen, die nicht auf dem Server sind). Merge ist additiv — Remote-Entfernungen deabonnieren lokale Feeds nicht. Passwort im Keychain (nie Klartext in Settings/Backup). Nicht synchronisiert (nur lokal): Episodenaktionen (Play/Download/Position), Warteschlange, Favoriten, Lesezeichen, Tags, Downloads, lokale Ordner-Feeds, Wiedergabefortschritt, Archiv, Inbox. Letzter Sync-Status und Fehler bleiben hier sichtbar. Standard-Host https://gpodder.net (änderbar)."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "gpodder.net Sync coverage help (honesty polish)"
    },
    "Nextcloud Gpodder Sync (beta — not full sync): same subscription limits as gpodder.net — additive http(s) feed URLs only; remote removes do not unsubscribe local feeds. Not synced: episode actions, queue, favorites, bookmarks, tags, downloads, local folder feeds, playback, archive, inbox. Enter Nextcloud base (server root or full API root like https://cloud.example.com/index.php/apps/gpoddersync/). HTTP Basic (app password recommended). Requires the Gpodder Sync app on the server. Device id is UI/state only (Nextcloud has no device API). Password in Keychain.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nextcloud Gpodder Sync (beta — not full sync): same subscription limits as gpodder.net — additive http(s) feed URLs only; remote removes do not unsubscribe local feeds. Not synced: episode actions, queue, favorites, bookmarks, tags, downloads, local folder feeds, playback, archive, inbox. Enter Nextcloud base (server root or full API root like https://cloud.example.com/index.php/apps/gpoddersync/). HTTP Basic (app password recommended). Requires the Gpodder Sync app on the server. Device id is UI/state only (Nextcloud has no device API). Password in Keychain."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nextcloud Gpodder Sync (Beta — kein voller Sync): gleiche Abonnement-Grenzen wie gpodder.net — nur additive http(s)-Feed-URLs; Remote-Entfernungen deabonnieren lokal nicht. Nicht synchronisiert: Episodenaktionen, Warteschlange, Favoriten, Lesezeichen, Tags, Downloads, lokale Ordner-Feeds, Wiedergabe, Archiv, Inbox. Nextcloud-Basis eingeben (Server-Root oder voller API-Root wie https://cloud.example.com/index.php/apps/gpoddersync/). HTTP Basic (App-Passwort empfohlen). Braucht die Gpodder-Sync-App auf dem Server. Geräte-ID nur UI/Status (Nextcloud hat keine Geräte-API). Passwort im Keychain."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Nextcloud Sync coverage help (honesty polish)"
    },
