    "Preserve pitch": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preserve pitch"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tonhöhe beibehalten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps natural pitch when changing playback speed. Off → chipmunk / slow voice. Default on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps natural pitch when changing playback speed. Off → chipmunk / slow voice. Default on."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hält die natürliche Tonhöhe bei Geschwindigkeitsänderung. Aus → Chipmunk / langsame Stimme. Standard an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on (default), keeps natural pitch while changing playback speed via `AVPlayerItem.audioTimePitchAlgorithm` `.timeDomain` (speech-oriented). When off, pitch scales with rate (`.varispeed` — chipmunk / slow voice). Stock `AVPlayer` only — not Android ExoPlayer / Sonic. Not Skip Silence.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on (default), keeps natural pitch while changing playback speed via `AVPlayerItem.audioTimePitchAlgorithm` `.timeDomain` (speech-oriented). When off, pitch scales with rate (`.varispeed` — chipmunk / slow voice). Stock `AVPlayer` only — not Android ExoPlayer / Sonic. Not Skip Silence."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv (Standard), bleibt die natürliche Tonhöhe bei Geschwindigkeitsänderung über `AVPlayerItem.audioTimePitchAlgorithm` `.timeDomain` (sprachorientiert). Aus → Tonhöhe skaliert mit der Rate (`.varispeed` — Chipmunk / langsame Stimme). Nur stock `AVPlayer` — nicht Android ExoPlayer / Sonic. Nicht Skip Silence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approximate wall-clock time: played episodes use saved duration (position cleared when marked played); in-progress use saved position. Not speed-adjusted — 1.5× does not shrink totals. Does not count rewinds, re-listens, or streaming with no saved progress. Played with unknown duration contribute 0. Derived from playback.json — no separate cumulative counter. Time range + optional Reset use lastPlayedAt (else updatedAt) — episode-level stamps, not per-session listen windows. History size limit may drop oldest entries and their stats.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Approximate wall-clock time: played episodes use saved duration (position cleared when marked played); in-progress use saved position. Not speed-adjusted — 1.5× does not shrink totals. Does not count rewinds, re-listens, or streaming with no saved progress. Played with unknown duration contribute 0. Derived from playback.json — no separate cumulative counter. Time range + optional Reset use lastPlayedAt (else updatedAt) — episode-level stamps, not per-session listen windows. History size limit may drop oldest entries and their stats."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ungefähre Wanduhr-Zeit: gehörte Episoden nutzen die gespeicherte Dauer (Position wird beim Als gehört markieren gelöscht); begonnene nutzen die gespeicherte Position. Nicht geschwindigkeitsbereinigt — 1,5× verkürzt die Summe nicht. Zählt keine Rückspulungen, erneutes Hören oder Streaming ohne gespeicherten Fortschritt. Gehört ohne bekannte Dauer zählt 0. Abgeleitet aus playback.json — kein separater kumulativer Zähler. Zeitraum + optionales Zurücksetzen nutzen lastPlayedAt (sonst updatedAt) — Episoden-Stempel, keine Sitzungsfenster. Verlaufs-Größenlimit kann älteste Einträge und deren Statistik entfernen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sorted by approximate listening time, then play count. Same wall-clock estimate as Totals per feed. Queue-only episodes without a known feed count in Totals but may omit a row here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sorted by approximate listening time, then play count. Same wall-clock estimate as Totals per feed. Queue-only episodes without a known feed count in Totals but may omit a row here."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sortiert nach ungefährer Hörzeit, dann nach Abspielanzahl. Gleiche Wanduhr-Schätzung wie die Summen pro Feed. Nur-Warteschlangen-Episoden ohne bekannten Feed zählen in den Summen, erscheinen hier aber ggf. nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All saved playback progress still in playback.json (since first progress or last Reset). Calendar follows the device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All saved playback progress still in playback.json (since first progress or last Reset). Calendar follows the device."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aller gespeicherter Wiedergabefortschritt in playback.json (seit erstem Fortschritt oder letztem Zurücksetzen). Kalender folgt dem Gerät."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filtered by lastPlayedAt (else updatedAt) in the selected device-calendar period, and after any Reset baseline.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filtered by lastPlayedAt (else updatedAt) in the selected device-calendar period, and after any Reset baseline."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gefiltert nach lastPlayedAt (sonst updatedAt) im gewählten Gerätekalender-Zeitraum und nach einer Zurücksetzen-Basislinie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Counting since %@ (after last Reset). History and progress stay.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Counting since %@ (after last Reset). History and progress stay."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zählt seit %@ (nach letztem Zurücksetzen). Verlauf und Fortschritt bleiben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
