            "value": "Statistik zurücksetzen?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sets a baseline timestamp so Statistics and Echo count only episodes last touched after now. Does not clear History, progress, played flags, downloads, queue, or favorites. Unlike Android there is no separate played-duration counter — this filters playback.json stamps. Episodes last played before the reset reappear only when played again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sets a baseline timestamp so Statistics and Echo count only episodes last touched after now. Does not clear History, progress, played flags, downloads, queue, or favorites. Unlike Android there is no separate played-duration counter — this filters playback.json stamps. Episodes last played before the reset reappear only when played again."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Setzt eine Basislinie, sodass Statistik und Echo nur Episoden zählen, die danach zuletzt berührt wurden. Löscht weder Verlauf, Fortschritt, Gehört-Status, Downloads, Warteschlange noch Favoriten. Anders als Android gibt es keinen separaten played-duration-Zähler — es filtert playback.json-Stempel. Vor dem Zurücksetzen zuletzt gespielte Episoden erscheinen erst wieder nach erneutem Abspielen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
