          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marks %lld unplayed, non-archived episodes as played. Uses the newest-500 All Episodes catalog by publish date, not the status, podcast, type, sort, or search filter; older episodes beyond the soft cap are not included. Auto-delete after playing still applies when enabled.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marks %lld unplayed, non-archived episodes as played. Uses the newest-500 All Episodes catalog by publish date, not the status, podcast, type, sort, or search filter; older episodes beyond the soft cap are not included. Auto-delete after playing still applies when enabled."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Markiert %lld ungehörte, nicht archivierte Episoden als gehört. Nutzt den Soft-Cap-Katalog (neueste 500) aller Episoden nach Veröffentlichungsdatum, nicht Status-, Podcast-, Typ-, Sortier- oder Suchfilter; ältere Episoden außerhalb des Soft-Caps sind nicht enthalten. Automatisches Löschen nach dem Abspielen gilt weiterhin, wenn aktiviert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marks %lld played episodes as unplayed, including archived episodes. Uses the newest-500 All Episodes catalog by publish date, not the status, podcast, type, sort, or search filter; older episodes beyond the soft cap are not included. Does not delete downloads, remove episodes from the queue, stop playback, or unarchive.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marks %lld played episodes as unplayed, including archived episodes. Uses the newest-500 All Episodes catalog by publish date, not the status, podcast, type, sort, or search filter; older episodes beyond the soft cap are not included. Does not delete downloads, remove episodes from the queue, stop playback, or unarchive."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Markiert %lld gehörte Episoden als ungehört, einschließlich archivierter Episoden. Nutzt den Soft-Cap-Katalog (neueste 500) aller Episoden nach Veröffentlichungsdatum, nicht Status-, Podcast-, Typ-, Sortier- oder Suchfilter; ältere Episoden außerhalb des Soft-Caps sind nicht enthalten. Löscht keine Downloads, entfernt keine Episoden aus der Warteschlange, stoppt die Wiedergabe nicht und hebt die Archivierung nicht auf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archives %lld non-archived episodes in the newest-500 All Episodes catalog by publish date, not the status, podcast, type, sort, or search filter; older episodes beyond the soft cap are not included. Archived does not mean played. Does not mark played, delete downloads, or clear the queue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Archives %lld non-archived episodes in the newest-500 All Episodes catalog by publish date, not the status, podcast, type, sort, or search filter; older episodes beyond the soft cap are not included. Archived does not mean played. Does not mark played, delete downloads, or clear the queue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Archiviert %lld nicht archivierte Episoden im Soft-Cap-Katalog (neueste 500) aller Episoden nach Veröffentlichungsdatum, nicht nach Status-, Podcast-, Typ-, Sortier- oder Suchfilter; ältere Episoden außerhalb des Soft-Caps sind nicht enthalten. Archiviert bedeutet nicht gehört. Markiert nicht als gehört, löscht keine Downloads und leert nicht die Warteschlange."
          }
        }
      }
    },
