    "Play episodes or mark them played. Totals are derived from saved playback progress — wall-clock duration or position in playback.json, not a separate cumulative counter. Streaming with no saved progress is not counted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play episodes or mark them played. Totals are derived from saved playback progress — wall-clock duration or position in playback.json, not a separate cumulative counter. Streaming with no saved progress is not counted."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Episoden abspielen oder als gehört markieren. Summen stammen aus gespeichertem Wiedergabefortschritt — Wanduhr-Dauer oder Position in playback.json, kein separater kumulativer Zähler. Streaming ohne gespeicherten Fortschritt zählt nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "History still has older playback, but Statistics only counts stamps after the last Reset. Play again or choose a wider time range. Reset does not clear History.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "History still has older playback, but Statistics only counts stamps after the last Reset. Play again or choose a wider time range. Reset does not clear History."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Verlauf enthält noch ältere Wiedergaben, aber die Statistik zählt nur Stempel nach dem letzten Zurücksetzen. Erneut abspielen oder einen größeren Zeitraum wählen. Zurücksetzen löscht den Verlauf nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No played or in-progress episodes with a last-played timestamp in this range (and after any Reset baseline). Try All time or another period.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No played or in-progress episodes with a last-played timestamp in this range (and after any Reset baseline). Try All time or another period."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keine gehörten oder begonnenen Episoden mit Zuletzt-gespielt-Stempel in diesem Zeitraum (und nach einer Zurücksetzen-Basislinie). Gesamte Zeit oder einen anderen Zeitraum versuchen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wall-clock estimate from saved duration or position, not speed-adjusted": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wall-clock estimate from saved duration or position, not speed-adjusted"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wanduhr-Schätzung aus gespeicherter Dauer oder Position, nicht geschwindigkeitsbereinigt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Per-feed rollup using the same wall-clock estimate as Totals": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Per-feed rollup using the same wall-clock estimate as Totals"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro-Feed-Zusammenfassung mit derselben Wanduhr-Schätzung wie die Summen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "(Approximate wall-clock — played use saved duration; in-progress use position. Not speed-adjusted. No rewinds, re-listens, or streaming without saved progress. Coarse episode stamps — lastPlayedAt else updatedAt; optional Reset baseline.)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "(Approximate wall-clock — played use saved duration; in-progress use position. Not speed-adjusted. No rewinds, re-listens, or streaming without saved progress. Coarse episode stamps — lastPlayedAt else updatedAt; optional Reset baseline.)"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "(Ungefähre Wanduhr — gehört nutzt gespeicherte Dauer; in Bearbeitung die Position. Nicht geschwindigkeitsbereinigt. Keine Rückspulungen, erneutes Hören oder Streaming ohne Fortschritt. Grobe Episoden-Stempel — lastPlayedAt sonst updatedAt; optionale Zurücksetzen-Basislinie.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approximate wall-clock: played episodes use lastPlayedAt (else updatedAt) and saved duration from playback.json — same limits as Statistics (incl. Reset baseline). Not speed-adjusted. Does not count rewinds, re-listens, or streaming without saved progress. Time range follows the device calendar; stamps are episode-level, not per-session.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Approximate wall-clock: played episodes use lastPlayedAt (else updatedAt) and saved duration from playback.json — same limits as Statistics (incl. Reset baseline). Not speed-adjusted. Does not count rewinds, re-listens, or streaming without saved progress. Time range follows the device calendar; stamps are episode-level, not per-session."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ungefähre Wanduhr: gehörte Episoden nutzen lastPlayedAt (sonst updatedAt) und gespeicherte Dauer aus playback.json — gleiche Grenzen wie Statistik (inkl. Zurücksetzen-Basislinie). Nicht geschwindigkeitsbereinigt. Zählt keine Rückspulungen, erneutes Hören oder Streaming ohne Fortschritt. Zeitraum folgt dem Gerätekalender; Stempel sind episodenbezogen, keine Sitzungen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filtered by lastPlayedAt (else updatedAt) / favoritedAt in the selected device-calendar period, and after any Statistics Reset baseline. Shared with Statistics.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filtered by lastPlayedAt (else updatedAt) / favoritedAt in the selected device-calendar period, and after any Statistics Reset baseline. Shared with Statistics."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gefiltert nach lastPlayedAt (sonst updatedAt) / favoritedAt im gewählten Gerätekalender-Zeitraum und nach einer Statistik-Zurücksetzen-Basislinie. Gemeinsam mit Statistik."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "(Approximate wall-clock — same limits as AntennaPod Statistics, including Reset baseline.)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "(Approximate wall-clock — same limits as AntennaPod Statistics, including Reset baseline.)"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "(Ungefähre Wanduhr — gleiche Grenzen wie AntennaPod-Statistik, inkl. Zurücksetzen-Basislinie.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, requests mono output via `AVAudioSession.setPreferredOutputNumberOfChannels(1)` (restores up to 2 when off). Reapplied on play, Settings change, and audio route change. **Best-effort** — the system may ignore this depending on the route (built-in speaker, Bluetooth, CarPlay, etc.). `AVMutableAudioMix` only scales track volume (no L+R→mono); a real remix needs `MTAudioProcessingTap` (file-based only, not HLS) or `AVAudioEngine` (would break video / PiP / Now Playing). Keeps stock `AVPlayer`. Not Android ExoPlayer stereo→mono remix. Default off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, requests mono output via `AVAudioSession.setPreferredOutputNumberOfChannels(1)` (restores up to 2 when off). Reapplied on play, Settings change, and audio route change. **Best-effort** — the system may ignore this depending on the route (built-in speaker, Bluetooth, CarPlay, etc.). `AVMutableAudioMix` only scales track volume (no L+R→mono); a real remix needs `MTAudioProcessingTap` (file-based only, not HLS) or `AVAudioEngine` (would break video / PiP / Now Playing). Keeps stock `AVPlayer`. Not Android ExoPlayer stereo→mono remix. Default off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, fordert Mono-Ausgabe über `AVAudioSession.setPreferredOutputNumberOfChannels(1)` an (aus: bis zu 2 Kanäle). Wird bei Wiedergabe, Settings-Änderung und Audio-Routenwechsel erneut angewendet. **Best Effort** — das System kann je nach Route (eingebauter Lautsprecher, Bluetooth, CarPlay usw.) ignorieren. `AVMutableAudioMix` skaliert nur Track-Lautstärke (kein L+R→Mono); echter Remix braucht `MTAudioProcessingTap` (nur dateibasiert, kein HLS) oder `AVAudioEngine` (würde Video / PiP / Now Playing brechen). Behält den Standard-`AVPlayer`. Kein Android-ExoPlayer-Stereo→Mono-Remix. Standard aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
