          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beim Speichern im Schlüsselbund — nie in feed-settings.json oder Backup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTP Basic for private feeds. Credentials are stored only in the Keychain on this device — never in feed-settings.json, OPML, or iOS JSON backup. Applied on feed refresh and on media downloads when the media host matches the feed host. Not used for local folder podcasts. Streaming without download may still fail if the player cannot send Authorization. Passwords are never logged.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP Basic for private feeds. Credentials are stored only in the Keychain on this device — never in feed-settings.json, OPML, or iOS JSON backup. Applied on feed refresh and on media downloads when the media host matches the feed host. Not used for local folder podcasts. Streaming without download may still fail if the player cannot send Authorization. Passwords are never logged."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP Basic für private Feeds. Zugangsdaten nur im Schlüsselbund auf diesem Gerät — nie in feed-settings.json, OPML oder iOS-JSON-Backup. Bei Feed-Aktualisierung und Mediendownloads, wenn der Medien-Host dem Feed-Host entspricht. Nicht für lokale Ordner-Podcasts. Streaming ohne Download kann scheitern, wenn der Player kein Authorization senden kann. Passwörter werden nie protokolliert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feed server returned HTTP 401 Unauthorized. Enter username and password under Podcast settings → Authentication (stored in Keychain), then refresh. Local folder feeds do not use HTTP auth.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Feed server returned HTTP 401 Unauthorized. Enter username and password under Podcast settings → Authentication (stored in Keychain), then refresh. Local folder feeds do not use HTTP auth."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Feed-Server meldete HTTP 401 Unauthorized. Benutzername und Passwort unter Podcast-Einstellungen → Authentifizierung eintragen (Schlüsselbund), dann aktualisieren. Lokale Ordner-Feeds nutzen keine HTTP-Auth."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download failed (HTTP 401 Unauthorized). Check Podcast settings → Authentication for this podcast (Keychain). Auth applies to the feed host only — not other CDN hosts. Streaming without download may still fail.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download failed (HTTP 401 Unauthorized). Check Podcast settings → Authentication for this podcast (Keychain). Auth applies to the feed host only — not other CDN hosts. Streaming without download may still fail."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download fehlgeschlagen (HTTP 401 Unauthorized). Authentifizierung unter Podcast-Einstellungen prüfen (Schlüsselbund). Auth gilt nur für den Feed-Host — nicht für andere CDN-Hosts. Streaming ohne Download kann weiterhin scheitern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTP 401 Unauthorized — enter username and password for this private feed, then Retry. After Confirm Subscribe, credentials are stored in the Keychain (not in feed-settings.json).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP 401 Unauthorized — enter username and password for this private feed, then Retry. After Confirm Subscribe, credentials are stored in the Keychain (not in feed-settings.json)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP 401 Unauthorized — Benutzername und Passwort für diesen privaten Feed eingeben, dann Erneut versuchen. Nach Bestätigen Abonnieren werden Zugangsdaten im Schlüsselbund gespeichert (nicht in feed-settings.json)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
