    "Beta iOS JSON backup (Application Support maps + Settings + gpodder prefs). Not AntennaPod Android DB. Optional offline media via the toggle (ZIP folder downloads/ ↔ Documents/downloads). gpodder password, Podcast Index keys, and per-feed HTTP Basic passwords stay in Keychain and are omitted from the ZIP. For a printable subscription list, use Import / Export → Export subscriptions as HTML.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beta iOS JSON backup (Application Support maps + Settings + gpodder prefs). Not AntennaPod Android DB. Optional offline media via the toggle (ZIP folder downloads/ ↔ Documents/downloads). gpodder password, Podcast Index keys, and per-feed HTTP Basic passwords stay in Keychain and are omitted from the ZIP. For a printable subscription list, use Import / Export → Export subscriptions as HTML."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beta-iOS-JSON-Backup (Application-Support-Maps + Einstellungen + gpodder-Prefs). Nicht die AntennaPod-Android-DB. Optionale Offline-Medien über den Schalter (ZIP-Ordner downloads/ ↔ Documents/downloads). gpodder-Passwort, Podcast-Index-Keys und HTTP-Basic-Passwörter pro Feed bleiben im Schlüsselbund und fehlen im ZIP. Für eine druckbare Abo-Liste: Import / Export → Abonnements als HTML exportieren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import finished. Media restored when present under downloads/ in the ZIP; otherwise re-download offline files. Re-enter gpodder / Podcast Index / per-feed HTTP Basic secrets if Keychain empty.": {
