            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optionaler HTTP(S)-Proxy für URLSession-Clients (Feeds, Downloads, Suche, …). AVPlayer-Streaming kann den App-Proxy umgehen. Keine VPN-Erkennung; kein Certificate Pinning; kein SOCKS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import picks an .opml or .xml from Files (document picker). Already subscribed feed URLs are skipped; each new feed is fetched over the network. Export writes AntennaPod-compatible OPML 2.0 — Share sheet or Save to Files. Local folder podcasts are omitted from OPML and HTML. HTML lists title, feed URL, and episode count; author, language, categories, and funding only when the feed provides them. No cloud sync.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import picks an .opml or .xml from Files (document picker). Already subscribed feed URLs are skipped; each new feed is fetched over the network. Export writes AntennaPod-compatible OPML 2.0 — Share sheet or Save to Files. Local folder podcasts are omitted from OPML and HTML. HTML lists title, feed URL, and episode count; author, language, categories, and funding only when the feed provides them. No cloud sync."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import wählt eine .opml- oder .xml-Datei aus Dateien (Dokumentenauswahl). Bereits abonnierte Feed-URLs werden übersprungen; jeder neue Feed wird über das Netzwerk geladen. Export schreibt AntennaPod-kompatibles OPML 2.0 — Share-Sheet oder In Dateien speichern. Lokale Ordner-Podcasts fehlen in OPML und HTML. HTML listet Titel, Feed-URL und Episodenanzahl; Autor, Sprache, Kategorien und Funding nur wenn der Feed sie liefert. Kein Cloud-Sync."
          }
        }
      }
    },
