    "Use global, Newest first, Oldest first, Shortest first, Longest first, Title A–Z, or Title Z–A for this podcast’s episode list. Does not follow itunes:type.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use global, Newest first, Oldest first, Shortest first, Longest first, Title A–Z, or Title Z–A for this podcast’s episode list. Does not follow itunes:type."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global verwenden, Neueste zuerst, Älteste zuerst, Kürzeste zuerst, Längste zuerst, Titel A–Z oder Titel Z–A für die Episodenliste dieses Podcasts. Folgt nicht itunes:type."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orders the Inbox list. Shortest and Longest use known duration; Title A–Z / Z–A by title; empty or unknown last. Home New preview stays newest-first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Orders the Inbox list. Shortest and Longest use known duration; Title A–Z / Z–A by title; empty or unknown last. Home New preview stays newest-first."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sortiert die Posteingangs-Liste. Kürzeste und Längste nutzen bekannte Dauer; Titel A–Z / Z–A nach Titel; leere oder unbekannte zuletzt. Home-Neu-Vorschau bleibt neueste zuerst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orders the All Episodes list within the newest-500 soft cap. Shortest and Longest use known duration; Title A–Z / Z–A by title; empty or unknown last. Does not pull older episodes beyond the cap.": {
