    "Sorts all %lld episodes in the entire queue by title, A to Z (not only the current filter). Empty titles go last. Does not stop playback, change progress, mark played, or delete downloads. The currently playing episode stays the same item and moves with its place in the list.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sorts all %lld episodes in the entire queue by title, A to Z (not only the current filter). Empty titles go last. Does not stop playback, change progress, mark played, or delete downloads. The currently playing episode stays the same item and moves with its place in the list."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sortiert alle %lld Episoden der gesamten Warteschlange nach Titel, A bis Z (nicht nur dem aktuellen Filter). Leere Titel kommen zuletzt. Stoppt die Wiedergabe nicht, ändert den Fortschritt nicht, markiert nicht als gehört und löscht keine Downloads. Die aktuell spielende Episode bleibt dieselbe und wandert mit ihrer neuen Position in der Liste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sorts all %lld episodes in the entire queue by title, Z to A (not only the current filter). Empty titles go last. Does not stop playback, change progress, mark played, or delete downloads. The currently playing episode stays the same item and moves with its place in the list.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sorts all %lld episodes in the entire queue by title, Z to A (not only the current filter). Empty titles go last. Does not stop playback, change progress, mark played, or delete downloads. The currently playing episode stays the same item and moves with its place in the list."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sortiert alle %lld Episoden der gesamten Warteschlange nach Titel, Z bis A (nicht nur dem aktuellen Filter). Leere Titel kommen zuletzt. Stoppt die Wiedergabe nicht, ändert den Fortschritt nicht, markiert nicht als gehört und löscht keine Downloads. Die aktuell spielende Episode bleibt dieselbe und wandert mit ihrer neuen Position in der Liste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
