      }
    },
    "When on, video episodes (MIME video/* or mp4/m4v/mov/webm) hide the video surface (artwork instead), disable AVPlayer video tracks, and skip PiP. Does not remux or strip video from the file; background audio continues; streaming/HLS may still download a video stream. Lockscreen / Now Playing stays audio. Default off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, video episodes (MIME video/* or mp4/m4v/mov/webm) hide the video surface (artwork instead), disable AVPlayer video tracks, and skip PiP. Does not remux or strip video from the file; background audio continues; streaming/HLS may still download a video stream. Lockscreen / Now Playing stays audio. Default off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, blenden Video-Episoden (MIME video/* oder mp4/m4v/mov/webm) die Videofläche aus (stattdessen Cover), deaktivieren AVPlayer-Video-Spuren und überspringen PiP. Remuxt oder entfernt Video nicht aus der Datei; Hintergrund-Audio läuft weiter; Streaming/HLS kann weiterhin einen Video-Stream laden. Sperrbildschirm/Now Playing bleibt Audio. Standard aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "http(s) alternate sources can play this episode in the app. Progress and mark-as-played stay on the episode. Chapters or transcripts may not match an alternate bitrate. Downloads use the primary enclosure — playing an alternate streams unless the URLs match. ipfs and magnet stay Copy or Open only. Video-as-audio, proxy, and Wi‑Fi stream settings still apply.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Honesty footnote: alternateEnclosure http(s) Play same episode; limits on chapters/download/ipfs.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "http(s) alternate sources can play this episode in the app. Progress and mark-as-played stay on the episode. Chapters or transcripts may not match an alternate bitrate. Downloads use the primary enclosure — playing an alternate streams unless the URLs match. ipfs and magnet stay Copy or Open only. Video-as-audio, proxy, and Wi‑Fi stream settings still apply."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "http(s)-Alternativquellen können diese Episode in der App abspielen. Fortschritt und Als gehört bleiben an der Episode. Kapitel oder Transkripte passen ggf. nicht zu einer anderen Bitrate. Downloads nutzen die primäre Enclosure — eine Alternative wird gestreamt, außer die URLs stimmen überein. ipfs und magnet bleiben nur Kopieren oder Öffnen. Video als Audio, Proxy und WLAN-Stream-Einstellungen gelten weiterhin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plays this episode using the alternate http(s) media URL from the feed": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "VoiceOver hint for Play on an alternateEnclosure http(s) source.",
      "localizations": {
