          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spielt diese Episode mit der alternativen http(s)-Medien-URL aus dem Feed ab"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copies the alternate media URI to the pasteboard. Only http(s) sources can play in the app.": {
