    "This podcast starts at %@ instead of Settings → Default speed (currently %@). Applied on a fresh episode start and when you change this setting while an episode from this podcast is playing. Player speed controls stay session-only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This podcast starts at %@ instead of Settings → Default speed (currently %@). Applied on a fresh episode start and when you change this setting while an episode from this podcast is playing. Player speed controls stay session-only."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Podcast startet mit %@ statt Einstellungen → Standardgeschwindigkeit (aktuell %@). Wird bei frischem Episodenstart und wenn du diese Einstellung änderst, während eine Episode dieses Podcasts spielt, angewendet. Player-Geschwindigkeit bleibt nur Sitzung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follows Settings → Default speed (currently %@). Applied on a fresh episode start and when you change this setting while an episode from this podcast is playing. Player speed controls stay session-only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follows Settings → Default speed (currently %@). Applied on a fresh episode start and when you change this setting while an episode from this podcast is playing. Player speed controls stay session-only."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folgt Einstellungen → Standardgeschwindigkeit (aktuell %@). Wird bei frischem Episodenstart und wenn du diese Einstellung änderst, während eine Episode dieses Podcasts spielt, angewendet. Player-Geschwindigkeit bleibt nur Sitzung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This podcast’s episodes use this speed (0.50×–3.00×, 0.05 steps). Applied on a fresh episode start and immediately if an episode from this podcast is already playing. Does not rewrite the player’s session rate from every tap — only this Feed setting (and Custom…) persists per feed. Stock AVPlayer — quality may degrade above ~2×.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This podcast’s episodes use this speed (0.50×–3.00×, 0.05 steps). Applied on a fresh episode start and immediately if an episode from this podcast is already playing. Does not rewrite the player’s session rate from every tap — only this Feed setting (and Custom…) persists per feed. Stock AVPlayer — quality may degrade above ~2×."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Episoden dieses Podcasts nutzen diese Geschwindigkeit (0,50×–3,00×, Schritte 0,05). Wird bei frischem Episodenstart und sofort angewendet, wenn bereits eine Episode dieses Podcasts spielt. Tippen im Player schreibt die Per-Feed-Geschwindigkeit nicht um — nur diese Feed-Einstellung (und Custom…) speichert pro Feed. Stock-AVPlayer — Qualität kann über ~2× nachlassen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sleep timer volume fade": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sleep timer volume fade"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schlaf-Timer-Lautstärke-Fade"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, clock sleep timer linearly lowers `AVPlayer.volume` over the last ~10 seconds before pause (Android `NOTIFICATION_THRESHOLD`). End-of-episode / end-of-chapter do **not** fade. Soft player volume only — **not** equal-loudness / ReplayGain; may be coarse with stock `AVPlayer`. Volume boost stays on `AVAudioMix`. Pause / seek / cancel timer restores pre-fade volume. Default **on** (Android always fades; no Android off-toggle).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, clock sleep timer linearly lowers `AVPlayer.volume` over the last ~10 seconds before pause (Android `NOTIFICATION_THRESHOLD`). End-of-episode / end-of-chapter do **not** fade. Soft player volume only — **not** equal-loudness / ReplayGain; may be coarse with stock `AVPlayer`. Volume boost stays on `AVAudioMix`. Pause / seek / cancel timer restores pre-fade volume. Default **on** (Android always fades; no Android off-toggle)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn an, senkt der Uhr-Schlaf-Timer `AVPlayer.volume` linear in den letzten ~10 Sekunden vor dem Pausieren (Android `NOTIFICATION_THRESHOLD`). Ende der Episode / des Kapitels **faden nicht**. Nur weiche Player-Lautstärke — **keine** Equal-Loudness / ReplayGain; mit stock-`AVPlayer` ggf. grob. Lautstärke-Verstärkung bleibt auf `AVAudioMix`. Pause / Seek / Timer abbrechen stellt die Lautstärke vor dem Fade wieder her. Standard **an** (Android fadet immer; kein Android-Aus-Schalter)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, clock sleep timer linearly lowers AVPlayer.volume over the last ~10 seconds before pause. End-of-episode / end-of-chapter do not fade. Not equal-loudness / ReplayGain; may be coarse with stock AVPlayer. Volume boost stays on AVAudioMix. Default on (Android always fades).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, clock sleep timer linearly lowers AVPlayer.volume over the last ~10 seconds before pause. End-of-episode / end-of-chapter do not fade. Not equal-loudness / ReplayGain; may be coarse with stock AVPlayer. Volume boost stays on AVAudioMix. Default on (Android always fades)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn an, senkt der Uhr-Schlaf-Timer AVPlayer.volume linear in den letzten ~10 Sekunden vor dem Pausieren. Ende der Episode / des Kapitels faden nicht. Keine Equal-Loudness / ReplayGain; mit stock-AVPlayer ggf. grob. Lautstärke-Verstärkung bleibt auf AVAudioMix. Standard an (Android fadet immer)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
