    "Notification permission was denied. AntennaPod will not show banners until you allow Notifications in iOS Settings (Open iOS Settings). Toggles stay on so your preference is clear. Local UserNotifications only — never push / APNs / server-side alerts. Download-complete is optional (default off).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notification permission was denied. AntennaPod will not show banners until you allow Notifications in iOS Settings (Open iOS Settings). Toggles stay on so your preference is clear. Local UserNotifications only — never push / APNs / server-side alerts. Download-complete is optional (default off)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Benachrichtigungsberechtigung wurde verweigert. AntennaPod zeigt keine Banner, bis du Benachrichtigungen in den iOS-Einstellungen erlaubst (iOS-Einstellungen öffnen). Schalter bleiben an, damit deine Präferenz klar ist. Nur lokale UserNotifications — nie Push / APNs / serverseitige Alerts. Download-Abschluss ist optional (Standard aus)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS permission is requested when you turn a notification toggle on, or when a refresh first finds new episodes / a download fails or completes / sync fails / sleep timer ends. Local UserNotifications only — no push / APNs / server-side alerts. Download-complete is optional (default off).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS permission is requested when you turn a notification toggle on, or when a refresh first finds new episodes / a download fails or completes / sync fails / sleep timer ends. Local UserNotifications only — no push / APNs / server-side alerts. Download-complete is optional (default off)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die iOS-Berechtigung wird angefragt, wenn du einen Benachrichtigungs-Schalter einschaltest oder wenn erstmals neue Episoden gefunden werden / ein Download fehlschlägt oder fertig ist / Sync fehlschlägt / der Sleep-Timer endet. Nur lokale UserNotifications — kein Push / APNs / serverseitige Alerts. Download-Abschluss ist optional (Standard aus)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local only — no APNs / push. OS Notifications permission required.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local only — no APNs / push. OS Notifications permission required."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur lokal — kein APNs / Push. OS-Benachrichtigungsberechtigung erforderlich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
