    "Marks %lld unplayed, non-archived History episode(s) as played. Uses the full History catalog (newest last-played first), not the podcast, search, or sort filter. Auto-delete after playing still applies when enabled; this does not clear History, remove episodes from the catalog, or delete downloads itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marks %lld unplayed, non-archived History episode(s) as played. Uses the full History catalog (newest last-played first), not the podcast, search, or sort filter. Auto-delete after playing still applies when enabled; this does not clear History, remove episodes from the catalog, or delete downloads itself."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Markiert %lld ungehörte, nicht archivierte Verlaufs-Episode(n) als gehört. Nutzt den vollständigen Verlaufs-Katalog (zuletzt gespielt zuerst), nicht den Podcast-, Such- oder Sortierfilter. Automatisches Löschen nach dem Abspielen gilt weiterhin, wenn aktiviert; diese Aktion leert den Verlauf nicht, entfernt keine Episoden aus dem Katalog und löscht Downloads nicht selbst."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "History Mark all as played confirmation — full catalog, unplayed non-archived eligibility, not podcast/search/sort."
    },
    "Marks %lld played episodes in History as unplayed (full catalog, not podcast or search filter). Episodes leave History when no progress remains — same as per-row Mark unplayed. Does not delete downloads, clear the queue, or stop playback.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marks %lld played episodes in History as unplayed (full catalog, not podcast or search filter). Episodes leave History when no progress remains — same as per-row Mark unplayed. Does not delete downloads, clear the queue, or stop playback."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Markiert %lld gehörte Episoden im Verlauf als ungehört (voller Katalog, nicht Podcast- oder Suchfilter). Episoden verlassen den Verlauf, wenn kein Fortschritt bleibt — wie pro Zeile Als ungehört. Löscht keine Downloads, leert nicht die Warteschlange und stoppt die Wiedergabe nicht."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "History Mark all as unplayed confirmation — full catalog played eligibility, not podcast/search."
