    "Play random": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Feed detail / Favorites / Downloads / Queue / History / Inbox / Archived ⋯: play a uniformly random playable episode. Feed: non-archived on this podcast. Favorites: full favorites catalog. Downloads: completed offline with local file. Queue: full queue with playable media. History: full history catalog. Inbox: full Inbox catalog (unplayed-only; prefer-unplayed no-op). Archived: full archived catalog (does not unarchive). Prefers unplayed when any remain; no confirm. Distinct from Queue Shuffle (reorder).",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play random"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zufällig abspielen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remaining time respects speed": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remaining time respects speed"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verbleibende Zeit berücksichtigt Tempo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, list and Home remaining-time info bars divide each episode’s remaining by that podcast’s effective playback speed (per-feed override or Default speed, clamped ≥ 0.5). Estimate only — not a live ETA. Does not use the current player session rate for list totals. Mini/full player −remaining and chapter list current remaining use the live session rate (fallback feed/default, 0.5…3.0). Volume boost is not speed. Default off (wall-clock). Widget / Watch Continue stay wall-clock.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, list and Home remaining-time info bars divide each episode’s remaining by that podcast’s effective playback speed (per-feed override or Default speed, clamped ≥ 0.5). Estimate only — not a live ETA. Does not use the current player session rate for list totals. Mini/full player −remaining and chapter list current remaining use the live session rate (fallback feed/default, 0.5…3.0). Volume boost is not speed. Default off (wall-clock). Widget / Watch Continue stay wall-clock."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, teilen Listen- und Home-Restzeit-Infoleisten die verbleibende Zeit jeder Episode durch die effektive Abspielgeschwindigkeit des Podcasts (Feed-Override oder Standardtempo, mindestens 0,5). Nur Schätzung — kein Live-ETA. Verwendet nicht die aktuelle Player-Session-Rate für Listen-Summen. Mini-/Vollbild-Player −Restzeit und Kapitel-Listen-Restzeit nutzen die Live-Session-Rate (Fallback Feed/Standard, 0,5…3,0). Lautstärke-Boost ist kein Tempo. Standard aus (Wanduhr). Widget / Watch Weiterhören bleiben Wanduhr."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, list remaining-time bars use each podcast’s playback speed; mini/full −remaining and chapter remaining use the live session rate. Default off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, list remaining-time bars use each podcast’s playback speed; mini/full −remaining and chapter remaining use the live session rate. Default off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, nutzen Listen-Restzeit-Leisten die Abspielgeschwindigkeit jedes Podcasts; Mini-/Vollbild −Restzeit und Kapitel-Restzeit die Live-Session-Rate. Standard aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download all unplayed": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
