    "Queues downloads for unplayed episodes in this podcast that are not archived and not already downloaded": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Queues downloads for unplayed episodes in this podcast that are not archived and not already downloaded"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stellt Downloads für ungehörte Episoden dieses Podcasts in die Warteschlange, die nicht archiviert und noch nicht heruntergeladen sind"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "VoiceOver hint for Feed detail Download all unplayed."
    },
    "Appends %lld episodes from this podcast to the end of the queue (newest publish date first). Already queued episodes are skipped. Uses the full feed episode catalog (same honesty as Download all unplayed / Mark all as played), not the chip or search filter. Includes played and archived. Queue lock does not block enqueue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appends %lld episodes from this podcast to the end of the queue (newest publish date first). Already queued episodes are skipped. Uses the full feed episode catalog (same honesty as Download all unplayed / Mark all as played), not the chip or search filter. Includes played and archived. Queue lock does not block enqueue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reiht %lld Episoden dieses Podcasts am Ende der Warteschlange ein (neuestes Erscheinungsdatum zuerst). Bereits eingereihte Episoden werden übersprungen. Nutzt den vollen Feed-Episodenkatalog (gleiche Ehrlichkeit wie Alle ungehörten herunterladen / Alle als gehört markieren), nicht Chip- oder Suchfilter. Einschließlich gehört und archiviert. Warteschlangen-Sperre blockiert Einreihen nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
