    "Cancels %lld in-progress or waiting download(s). Stops active transfers and clears the waiting queue. Does not delete completed offline files.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancels %lld in-progress or waiting download(s). Stops active transfers and clears the waiting queue. Does not delete completed offline files."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bricht %lld laufende oder wartende Download(s) ab. Stoppt aktive Übertragungen und leert die Warteschlange. Löscht keine abgeschlossenen Offline-Dateien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add all unplayed to queue": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Feed detail ⋯: bulk enqueue unplayed/not-archived/not-queued in effective episode sort; confirm with eligible count.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add all unplayed to queue"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alle ungehörten zur Warteschlange hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add all unplayed to queue?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Confirmation title for Feed detail Add all unplayed to queue.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add all unplayed to queue?"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alle ungehörten zur Warteschlange hinzufügen?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appends %lld unplayed, non-archived episodes to the end of the queue (newest first within the newest-500 soft cap). Already queued, played, and archived episodes are skipped. Uses the soft-capped All Episodes catalog (newest 500 by publish date), not the status, podcast, type, sort, or search filter; older episodes beyond the soft cap are not included. Queue lock does not block enqueue. Distinct from Add all to queue, which also includes played and archived episodes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Confirmation message for All Episodes Add all unplayed to queue.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appends %lld unplayed, non-archived episodes to the end of the queue (newest first within the newest-500 soft cap). Already queued, played, and archived episodes are skipped. Uses the soft-capped All Episodes catalog (newest 500 by publish date), not the status, podcast, type, sort, or search filter; older episodes beyond the soft cap are not included. Queue lock does not block enqueue. Distinct from Add all to queue, which also includes played and archived episodes."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reiht %lld ungehörte, nicht archivierte Episoden aller Episoden am Ende der Warteschlange ein (neuestes zuerst innerhalb des Soft-Caps der neuesten 500). Bereits eingereihte, gehörte und archivierte Episoden werden übersprungen. Nutzt den Soft-Cap-Katalog aller Episoden (neueste 500 nach Veröffentlichungsdatum), nicht Status-, Podcast-, Typ-, Sortier- oder Suchfilter; ältere Episoden außerhalb des Soft-Caps sind nicht enthalten. Die Warteschlangen-Sperre blockiert das Einreihen nicht. Unterschiedlich von Alle zur Warteschlange, das auch gehörte und archivierte Episoden einschließt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appends %lld unplayed episodes from this podcast to the end of the queue in this podcast’s episode sort order (per-feed or global). Played, archived, and already queued episodes are skipped. Uses the full feed episode catalog (same honesty as Download all unplayed / Mark all as played), not the chip or search filter. Queue lock does not block enqueue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Confirmation message for Feed detail Add all unplayed to queue.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appends %lld unplayed episodes from this podcast to the end of the queue in this podcast’s episode sort order (per-feed or global). Played, archived, and already queued episodes are skipped. Uses the full feed episode catalog (same honesty as Download all unplayed / Mark all as played), not the chip or search filter. Queue lock does not block enqueue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reiht %lld ungehörte Episoden dieses Podcasts am Ende der Warteschlange in der Episodensortierreihenfolge dieses Podcasts ein (pro Feed oder global). Gehörte, archivierte und bereits eingereihte Episoden werden übersprungen. Nutzt den vollen Feed-Episodenkatalog (gleiche Ehrlichkeit wie Alle ungehörten herunterladen / Alle als gehört markieren), nicht den Chip- oder Suchfilter. Die Warteschlangen-Sperre blockiert das Einreihen nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appends %lld episodes from this podcast to the end of the queue (newest publish date first). Already queued episodes are skipped. Uses the full feed episode catalog (same honesty as Download all unplayed / Mark all as played), not the chip or search filter. Includes played and archived. Queue lock does not block enqueue. Distinct from Add all unplayed to queue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Confirmation message for Feed detail Add all to queue (includes played/archived).",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appends %lld episodes from this podcast to the end of the queue (newest publish date first). Already queued episodes are skipped. Uses the full feed episode catalog (same honesty as Download all unplayed / Mark all as played), not the chip or search filter. Includes played and archived. Queue lock does not block enqueue. Distinct from Add all unplayed to queue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reiht %lld Episoden dieses Podcasts am Ende der Warteschlange ein (neuestes Erscheinungsdatum zuerst). Bereits eingereihte Episoden werden übersprungen. Nutzt den vollen Feed-Episodenkatalog (gleiche Ehrlichkeit wie Alle ungehörten herunterladen / Alle als gehört markieren), nicht den Chip- oder Suchfilter. Einschließlich gehörter und archivierter. Die Warteschlangen-Sperre blockiert das Einreihen nicht. Unterschiedlich von Alle ungehörten zur Warteschlange hinzufügen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
