    "When on, this podcast stays above unpinned podcasts on Subscriptions for every sort (Recently updated, Alphabetical, …). Local preference only — not a separate sort mode; not synced to gpodder; cleared when you unsubscribe. Included in iOS JSON backup with other feed settings.": {
