    },
    "When on, disables Queue drag reorder, Shuffle, Shuffle (keep playing first), Reverse order, Sort by date, Sort by duration, Sort by title, Move playing to top, Move playing to bottom, and Move to top or bottom. Enqueue, Play Next, Remove, and Clear queue still work. Default off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, disables Queue drag reorder, Shuffle, Shuffle (keep playing first), Reverse order, Sort by date, Sort by duration, Sort by title, Move playing to top, Move playing to bottom, and Move to top or bottom. Enqueue, Play Next, Remove, and Clear queue still work. Default off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, deaktiviert Warteschlangen-Ziehen-Neuordnen, Mischen, Mischen (aktuell spielende zuerst), Umkehren, Nach Datum sortieren, Nach Dauer sortieren, Nach Titel sortieren, Aktuelle Wiedergabe an den Anfang, Aktuelle Wiedergabe an das Ende und An Anfang/Ende. Einreihen, Als Nächstes, Entfernen und Warteschlange leeren bleiben. Standard aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, disables Queue drag reorder, Shuffle, Shuffle (keep playing first), Reverse order, Sort by date, Sort by duration, Sort by title, Move playing to top, Move playing to bottom, and Move to top or bottom. Enqueue, Play Next, Remove, Remove played, and Clear queue still work. Default off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, disables Queue drag reorder, Shuffle, Shuffle (keep playing first), Reverse order, Sort by date, Sort by duration, Sort by title, Move playing to top, Move playing to bottom, and Move to top or bottom. Enqueue, Play Next, Remove, Remove played, and Clear queue still work. Default off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, deaktiviert Warteschlangen-Ziehen-Neuordnen, Mischen, Mischen (aktuell spielende zuerst), Umkehren, Nach Datum sortieren, Nach Dauer sortieren, Nach Titel sortieren, Aktuelle Wiedergabe an den Anfang, Aktuelle Wiedergabe an das Ende und An Anfang/Ende. Einreihen, Als Nächstes, Entfernen, Gehörte entfernen und Warteschlange leeren bleiben. Standard aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, the Queue tab disables Edit drag reorder, Shuffle, Shuffle (keep playing first), Reverse order, Sort by date, Sort by duration, Sort by title, Move playing to top, Move playing to bottom, and hides EpisodeRow Move to top / Move to bottom. Enqueue, Play Next, Remove, Archive swipe, and Clear queue stay available (reorder lock only — same idea as AntennaPod Android queue lock). Same preference as the Queue toolbar lock button. Default off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, the Queue tab disables Edit drag reorder, Shuffle, Shuffle (keep playing first), Reverse order, Sort by date, Sort by duration, Sort by title, Move playing to top, Move playing to bottom, and hides EpisodeRow Move to top / Move to bottom. Enqueue, Play Next, Remove, Archive swipe, and Clear queue stay available (reorder lock only — same idea as AntennaPod Android queue lock). Same preference as the Queue toolbar lock button. Default off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, deaktiviert der Warteschlangen-Tab Bearbeiten-Ziehen-Neuordnen, Mischen, Mischen (aktuell spielende zuerst), Umkehren, Nach Datum sortieren, Nach Dauer sortieren, Nach Titel sortieren, Aktuelle Wiedergabe an den Anfang, Aktuelle Wiedergabe an das Ende und blendet An Anfang / Ans Ende aus. Einreihen, Als Nächstes, Entfernen, Archiv-Swipe und Warteschlange leeren bleiben (nur Reihenfolge-Sperre — wie AntennaPod Android). Gleiche Einstellung wie der Warteschlangen-Toolbar-Sperr-Button. Standard aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, the Queue tab disables Edit drag reorder, Shuffle, Shuffle (keep playing first), Reverse order, Sort by date, Sort by duration, Sort by title, Move playing to top, Move playing to bottom, and hides EpisodeRow Move to top / Move to bottom. Enqueue, Play Next, Remove, Remove played, Archive swipe, and Clear queue stay available (reorder lock only — same idea as AntennaPod Android queue lock). Same preference as the Queue toolbar lock button. Default off.": {
