          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, the Queue tab disables Edit drag reorder, Shuffle, Shuffle (keep playing first), Reverse order, Sort by date, Sort by duration, Sort by title, Move playing to top, Move playing to bottom, and hides EpisodeRow Move to top / Move to bottom. Enqueue, Play Next, Remove, Remove played, Archive swipe, and Clear queue stay available (reorder lock only — same idea as AntennaPod Android queue lock). Same preference as the Queue toolbar lock button. Default off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
