    "Marks %lld unplayed, non-archived favorite episode(s) as played. Uses the full Favorites catalog (newest favorited first), not the podcast, search, or sort filter. Auto-delete after playing still applies when enabled; this does not clear Favorites, unfavorite episodes, or delete downloads itself.": {
