    "Appends %lld unplayed, non-archived downloaded episode(s) to the end of the queue (catalog order — oldest completed first). Already queued, played, and archived episodes are skipped. Uses the full completed Downloads catalog, not the chip, podcast, search, or sort filter. Queue lock does not block enqueue. Distinct from Add all to queue, which also includes played and archived downloads.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Downloads Add all unplayed to queue confirmation message — full completed catalog, not chip/podcast/search/sort.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appends %lld unplayed, non-archived downloaded episode(s) to the end of the queue (catalog order — oldest completed first). Already queued, played, and archived episodes are skipped. Uses the full completed Downloads catalog, not the chip, podcast, search, or sort filter. Queue lock does not block enqueue. Distinct from Add all to queue, which also includes played and archived downloads."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reiht %lld ungehörte, nicht archivierte heruntergeladene Episode(n) am Ende der Warteschlange ein (Katalogreihenfolge — älteste abgeschlossene zuerst). Bereits eingereihte, gehörte und archivierte Episoden werden übersprungen. Nutzt den vollständigen Downloads-Katalog, nicht Chip-, Podcast-, Such- oder Sortierfilter. Warteschlangen-Sperre blockiert Einreihen nicht. Unterschiedlich von Alle zur Warteschlange, das auch gehörte und archivierte Downloads einschließt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy downloads, share downloads, play random, add all to queue, add all unplayed to queue, mark all as played, mark all as unplayed, archive all, cancel all downloads, delete played downloads, or delete all downloads": {
