      }
    },
    "Marks %lld played episodes from the full stored feed catalog behind Inbox as unplayed, including archived episodes. Uses the catalog scope, not the podcast, episode type, search, or sort filter. Does not delete downloads, clear the queue, stop playback, or unarchive episodes.": {
