    "Appends %lld unplayed, non-archived Inbox episode(s) to the end of the queue (newest first). Already queued, played, and archived episodes are skipped. Uses the full current Inbox catalog, not the podcast, episode type, search, or sort filter. Inbox is already unplayed-only in normal operation, so this may match Add all to queue. Queue lock does not block enqueue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Inbox Add all unplayed to queue confirmation — full catalog, not UI filters.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appends %lld unplayed, non-archived Inbox episode(s) to the end of the queue (newest first). Already queued, played, and archived episodes are skipped. Uses the full current Inbox catalog, not the podcast, episode type, search, or sort filter. Inbox is already unplayed-only in normal operation, so this may match Add all to queue. Queue lock does not block enqueue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reiht %lld ungehörte, nicht archivierte Inbox-Episode(n) am Ende der Warteschlange ein (neueste zuerst). Bereits eingereihte, gehörte und archivierte Episoden werden übersprungen. Nutzt den vollständigen aktuellen Inbox-Katalog, nicht den Podcast-, Episodentyp-, Such- oder Sortierfilter. Da der Inbox normalerweise nur ungehörte Episoden enthält, kann dies Alle zur Warteschlange entsprechen. Die Warteschlangen-Sperre blockiert das Einreihen nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
