    "Never. No bulk subscription refresh has finished yet. This is not a per-podcast Last refreshed time, and no timestamp is invented.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Never. No bulk subscription refresh has finished yet. This is not a per-podcast Last refreshed time, and no timestamp is invented."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie. Es wurde noch keine Sammelaktualisierung der Abos abgeschlossen. Das ist nicht die Zeit „Zuletzt aktualisiert“ eines einzelnen Podcasts, und es wird kein Zeitpunkt erfunden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bulk refresh finished %@. The stamp is written when Refresh all finishes, even if some podcasts failed. It is not each podcast's Last refreshed time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bulk refresh finished %@. The stamp is written when Refresh all finishes, even if some podcasts failed. It is not each podcast's Last refreshed time."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sammelaktualisierung abgeschlossen %@. Der Stempel wird geschrieben, wenn Alle aktualisieren fertig ist, auch wenn einzelne Podcasts fehlschlagen. Das ist nicht die Zeit „Zuletzt aktualisiert“ jedes Podcasts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never. No subscription sync has finished yet. Login alone does not write this time, and no timestamp is invented. This is not each podcast's Last refreshed time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Never. No subscription sync has finished yet. Login alone does not write this time, and no timestamp is invented. This is not each podcast's Last refreshed time."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie. Es wurde noch kein Abo-Sync abgeschlossen. Alleiniges Anmelden schreibt diese Zeit nicht, und es wird kein Zeitpunkt erfunden. Das ist nicht die Zeit „Zuletzt aktualisiert“ jedes Podcasts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subscription sync finished %@. The stamp is written when Sync now finishes the http(s) feed URL pull and push, even if some new subscriptions failed. A failed sync that throws before finishing keeps the previous time. It is not episode actions, queue, bookmarks, or each podcast's Last refreshed time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subscription sync finished %@. The stamp is written when Sync now finishes the http(s) feed URL pull and push, even if some new subscriptions failed. A failed sync that throws before finishing keeps the previous time. It is not episode actions, queue, bookmarks, or each podcast's Last refreshed time."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abo-Sync abgeschlossen %@. Der Stempel wird geschrieben, wenn Jetzt synchronisieren den Abruf und Upload der http(s)-Feed-URLs beendet, auch wenn einige neue Abos fehlschlagen. Ein Sync, der vor dem Abschluss fehlschlägt, behält die vorherige Zeit. Das sind nicht Episodenaktionen, Warteschlange, Lesezeichen oder die Zeit „Zuletzt aktualisiert“ jedes Podcasts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subscriptions only: additive http(s) feed URLs. Not a full sync. Logout does not clear this time. Local folders are not pushed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subscriptions only: additive http(s) feed URLs. Not a full sync. Logout does not clear this time. Local folders are not pushed."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur Abonnements: additive http(s)-Feed-URLs. Kein vollständiger Sync. Abmelden löscht diese Zeit nicht. Lokale Ordner werden nicht hochgeladen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off. This global switch does not enqueue episodes. A per-podcast Always override can still enqueue newly appeared episodes for that podcast. The unplayed backlog is not downloaded, and no download is invented.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off. This global switch does not enqueue episodes. A per-podcast Always override can still enqueue newly appeared episodes for that podcast. The unplayed backlog is not downloaded, and no download is invented."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus. Dieser globale Schalter reiht keine Episoden ein. Eine Immer-Überschreibung pro Podcast kann für diesen Podcast weiterhin neu erschienene Episoden einreihen. Der ungehörte Rückstand wird nicht geladen, und es wird kein Download erfunden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On. After a successful feed refresh, up to %lld newly appeared unplayed episode(s) per feed may be enqueued. Not the whole unplayed backlog.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On. After a successful feed refresh, up to %lld newly appeared unplayed episode(s) per feed may be enqueued. Not the whole unplayed backlog."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein. Nach einer erfolgreichen Feed-Aktualisierung können bis zu %lld neu erschienene ungehörte Episode(n) pro Feed eingereiht werden. Nicht der gesamte ungehörte Rückstand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. This cap counts only newly appeared unplayed episodes after a successful feed refresh, not the unplayed backlog.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@. This cap counts only newly appeared unplayed episodes after a successful feed refresh, not the unplayed backlog."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@. Diese Obergrenze zählt nur neu erschienene ungehörte Episoden nach einer erfolgreichen Feed-Aktualisierung, nicht den ungehörten Rückstand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shown only while global auto-download is on. The same cap applies when a podcast is set to Always. Per-podcast Never still skips that podcast. Does not change the Wi‑Fi-only gate under Network / Downloads. Local-folder feeds are skipped. Not a silent background download.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shown only while global auto-download is on. The same cap applies when a podcast is set to Always. Per-podcast Never still skips that podcast. Does not change the Wi‑Fi-only gate under Network / Downloads. Local-folder feeds are skipped. Not a silent background download."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur sichtbar, solange automatischer Download global an ist. Dieselbe Obergrenze gilt, wenn ein Podcast auf Immer steht. Nie pro Podcast überspringt diesen Podcast trotzdem. Ändert nicht die Nur-Wi‑Fi-Sperre unter Netzwerk / Downloads. Lokale-Ordner-Feeds werden übersprungen. Kein stiller Hintergrund-Download."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto-download help": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto-download help"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hilfe zum automatischen Download"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking. The system path monitor has not delivered a sample, so this is not Wi‑Fi, Ethernet, cellular, offline, or another network. No status is invented.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checking. The system path monitor has not delivered a sample, so this is not Wi‑Fi, Ethernet, cellular, offline, or another network. No status is invented."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prüfe. Der System-Pfadmonitor hat noch keine Messung geliefert, also ist das weder Wi‑Fi, Ethernet, Mobilfunk, offline noch ein anderes Netz. Es wird kein Status erfunden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Locked. Enter the parental PIN to change this toggle. The saved On or Off choice stays until then.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Locked. Enter the parental PIN to change this toggle. The saved On or Off choice stays until then."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gesperrt. Gib die Eltern-PIN ein, um diesen Schalter zu ändern. Die gespeicherte Wahl An oder Aus bleibt bis dahin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On.": {
