    "User-started downloads are refused unless the path is Wi‑Fi or Ethernet, and a download error is recorded. Files already saved stay. This does not start a download.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "User-started downloads are refused unless the path is Wi‑Fi or Ethernet, and a download error is recorded. Files already saved stay. This does not start a download."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vom Nutzer gestartete Downloads werden abgelehnt, außer der Pfad ist Wi‑Fi oder Ethernet, und ein Download-Fehler wird protokolliert. Bereits gespeicherte Dateien bleiben. Das startet keinen Download."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User-started downloads are not limited to Wi‑Fi or Ethernet by this toggle. A missing network can still fail the transfer. No Wi‑Fi-only error is recorded just because this is off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "User-started downloads are not limited to Wi‑Fi or Ethernet by this toggle. A missing network can still fail the transfer. No Wi‑Fi-only error is recorded just because this is off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vom Nutzer gestartete Downloads sind durch diesen Schalter nicht auf Wi‑Fi oder Ethernet beschränkt. Ein fehlendes Netz kann die Übertragung trotzdem scheitern lassen. Nur weil dies aus ist, wird kein Nur-Wi‑Fi-Fehler protokolliert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Network streaming is blocked unless the path is Wi‑Fi or Ethernet. Local offline files still play. This does not download the episode.": {
