            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Banner für Sync- und Anmeldefehler bleiben aus. Das postet kein Banner und startet keinen Sync."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sleep-timer banners and the foreground haptic stay off. The timer itself is unchanged. This toggle does not start or end a timer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
