    },
    "No further episodes in the queue": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No further episodes in the queue"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keine weiteren Episoden in der Warteschlange"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never auto-download this podcast, even when global Auto-download is on. New episodes Add to Queue and download still enqueues but does not download. Manual Download still works.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Never auto-download this podcast, even when global Auto-download is on. New episodes Add to Queue and download still enqueues but does not download. Manual Download still works."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lädt diesen Podcast nie automatisch herunter, auch wenn globales Auto-Download an ist. Neue Episoden „Zur Warteschlange hinzufügen und herunterladen“ reiht weiterhin ein, lädt aber nicht herunter. Manueller Download funktioniert weiterhin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When over the limit, played downloads that are not favorited and not queued are deleted first (oldest file first), then unplayed non-favorite non-queued (LRU by file date). Favorites and queued episodes are never auto-deleted by this budget. Runs after each successful download, when opening Settings, and on launch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When over the limit, played downloads that are not favorited and not queued are deleted first (oldest file first), then unplayed non-favorite non-queued (LRU by file date). Favorites and queued episodes are never auto-deleted by this budget. Runs after each successful download, when opening Settings, and on launch."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bei Überschreitung werden zuerst gehörte Downloads gelöscht, die nicht favorisiert und nicht in der Warteschlange sind (älteste Datei zuerst), danach ungehörte nicht-favorisierte nicht-eingereihte (LRU nach Dateidatum). Favoriten und Warteschlangen-Episoden werden durch dieses Kontingent nie automatisch gelöscht. Läuft nach jedem erfolgreichen Download, beim Öffnen der Einstellungen und beim Start."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Queues download of %lld of %lld eligible unplayed episodes (newest first, soft cap %lld).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Queues download of %lld of %lld eligible unplayed episodes (newest first, soft cap %lld)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stellt den Download von %lld von %lld geeigneten ungehörten Episoden in die Warteschlange (neueste zuerst, Soft-Cap %lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Queues download of %lld unplayed episodes (newest first, soft cap %lld).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Queues download of %lld unplayed episodes (newest first, soft cap %lld)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stellt den Download von %lld ungehörten Episoden in die Warteschlange (neueste zuerst, Soft-Cap %lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Played, archived, already downloaded, and local-folder files are skipped. Requires http(s) enclosure. Uses the full feed catalog — not the chip or search filter. Manual download Wi‑Fi only, parallel-download cap, and storage limit still apply.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Played, archived, already downloaded, and local-folder files are skipped. Requires http(s) enclosure. Uses the full feed catalog — not the chip or search filter. Manual download Wi‑Fi only, parallel-download cap, and storage limit still apply."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gehörte, archivierte, bereits heruntergeladene und Lokalordner-Dateien werden übersprungen. Erfordert http(s)-Enclosure. Nutzt den vollständigen Feed-Katalog — nicht Chip- oder Suchfilter. Manuelles Download nur per WLAN, Parallel-Download-Limit und Speicherlimit gelten weiterhin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Queues the %lld newest eligible unplayed downloads (soft cap %lld; %lld match on this podcast). Skips played, archived, already downloaded, and local-folder files.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Queues the %lld newest eligible unplayed downloads (soft cap %lld; %lld match on this podcast). Skips played, archived, already downloaded, and local-folder files."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reiht die %lld neuesten geeigneten ungehörten Downloads ein (Soft-Cap %lld; %lld passen bei diesem Podcast). Überspringt gehörte, archivierte, bereits heruntergeladene und Lokalordner-Dateien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Queues downloads for unplayed episodes in this podcast that are not archived and not already downloaded (soft cap %lld).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Queues downloads for unplayed episodes in this podcast that are not archived and not already downloaded (soft cap %lld)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reiht Downloads für ungehörte Episoden in diesem Podcast ein, die nicht archiviert und noch nicht heruntergeladen sind (Soft-Cap %lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marks %lld unplayed, non-archived episodes in this podcast as played. Uses the full feed catalog — not the status, episode type, search, or sort filter. Does not archive; auto-delete after playing still applies when enabled.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marks %lld unplayed, non-archived episodes in this podcast as played. Uses the full feed catalog — not the status, episode type, search, or sort filter. Does not archive; auto-delete after playing still applies when enabled."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Markiert %lld ungehörte, nicht archivierte Episoden in diesem Podcast als gehört. Nutzt den vollständigen Feed-Katalog — nicht Status-, Episodentyp-, Such- oder Sortierfilter. Archiviert nicht; Auto-Löschen nach dem Abspielen gilt weiterhin, wenn aktiv."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marks %lld played episodes in this podcast as unplayed (including archived). Uses the full feed catalog — not the status, episode type, search, or sort filter. Does not delete downloads, remove from queue, stop playback, or unarchive.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marks %lld played episodes in this podcast as unplayed (including archived). Uses the full feed catalog — not the status, episode type, search, or sort filter. Does not delete downloads, remove from queue, stop playback, or unarchive."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Markiert %lld gehörte Episoden in diesem Podcast als ungehört (einschließlich archivierter). Nutzt den vollständigen Feed-Katalog — nicht Status-, Episodentyp-, Such- oder Sortierfilter. Löscht keine Downloads, entfernt nicht aus der Warteschlange, stoppt die Wiedergabe nicht und stellt Archive nicht wieder her."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Feed detail Mark all as unplayed confirmation — full-feed played count including archived."
    },
    "Marks %lld Inbox episodes as played. Episodes leave the Inbox; auto-delete after playing still applies when enabled. Uses the full Inbox catalog, not the podcast, episode type, search, or sort filter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marks %lld Inbox episodes as played. Episodes leave the Inbox; auto-delete after playing still applies when enabled. Uses the full Inbox catalog, not the podcast, episode type, search, or sort filter."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Markiert %lld Posteingangs-Episoden als gehört. Episoden verlassen den Posteingang; Auto-Löschen nach dem Abspielen gilt weiterhin, wenn aktiviert. Nutzt den gesamten Posteingangs-Katalog, nicht den Podcast-, Episodentyp-, Such- oder Sortierfilter."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Always delete this podcast’s offline file when an episode is marked played, even when the global toggle is off. Favorites still keep their offline files. Defers while that local file is the active player item.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Always delete this podcast’s offline file when an episode is marked played, even when the global toggle is off. Favorites still keep their offline files. Defers while that local file is the active player item."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Löscht die Offline-Datei dieses Podcasts immer, wenn eine Episode als gehört markiert wird — auch wenn der globale Schalter aus ist. Favoriten behalten ihre Offline-Dateien. Verschiebt das Löschen, solange diese lokale Datei das aktive Player-Element ist."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Set a 4–6 digit PIN to restrict Add / Discover (including Import OPML) and optionally Network / Downloads settings or explicit charts. Beta MVP — not a full device parental lock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set a 4–6 digit PIN to restrict Add / Discover (including Import OPML) and optionally Network / Downloads settings or explicit charts. Beta MVP — not a full device parental lock."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lege eine 4–6-stellige PIN fest, um Hinzufügen / Entdecken (einschließlich OPML-Import) und optional Netzwerk-/Download-Einstellungen oder explizite Charts einzuschränken. Beta-MVP — kein vollständiger Geräte-Elternschutz."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Import OPML (PIN required)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import OPML (PIN required)"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OPML importieren (PIN erforderlich)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lock Add / Discover asks for the PIN before the Add sheet, Discover charts, or Import OPML (Settings and Subscriptions). Lock Network / Downloads blocks Wi‑Fi-only toggles until unlocked. Hide explicit top charts requests iTunes charts with explicit=false while parental controls are enabled — unlocking the session does not turn this filter off; turn the toggle off or disable parental controls. Export OPML stays unlocked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lock Add / Discover asks for the PIN before the Add sheet, Discover charts, or Import OPML (Settings and Subscriptions). Lock Network / Downloads blocks Wi‑Fi-only toggles until unlocked. Hide explicit top charts requests iTunes charts with explicit=false while parental controls are enabled — unlocking the session does not turn this filter off; turn the toggle off or disable parental controls. Export OPML stays unlocked."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hinzufügen / Entdecken sperren fragt vor dem Hinzufügen-Sheet, Entdecken-Charts oder OPML-Import (Einstellungen und Abonnements) nach der PIN. Netzwerk / Downloads sperren blockiert Nur-Wi‑Fi-Schalter bis zur Entsperrung. Explizite Top-Charts ausblenden fordert iTunes-Charts mit explicit=false an, solange der Elternschutz aktiv ist — Entsperren der Sitzung schaltet diesen Filter nicht aus; Schalter aus oder Elternschutz deaktivieren. OPML-Export bleibt entsperrt."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Removes the Keychain password and clears sync cursors. Host, username, device name, and device id stay for re-login. Last sync time stays; status becomes Logged out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removes the Keychain password and clears sync cursors. Host, username, device name, and device id stay for re-login. Last sync time stays; status becomes Logged out."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entfernt das Keychain-Passwort und löscht Sync-Cursor. Host, Benutzername, Gerätename und Geräte-ID bleiben für erneutes Login. Die Letzte-Sync-Zeit bleibt; der Status wird Abgemeldet."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Caption for this sync device. Login and Sync now push it to the server when logged in; editing alone does not sync. Distinct from Regenerate device id from name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caption for this sync device. Login and Sync now push it to the server when logged in; editing alone does not sync. Distinct from Regenerate device id from name."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bezeichnung für dieses Sync-Gerät. Login und Jetzt synchronisieren senden sie an den Server, wenn angemeldet; alleiniges Bearbeiten synchronisiert nicht. Unterschiedlich von Geräte-ID aus Name neu erzeugen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This replaces subscriptions, queue, playback, favorites, archive, bookmarks, private episode notes, tags, feed settings, download catalog, download error log, local-folder bookmarks, Settings prefs, and gpodder sync prefs with the backup. If the ZIP includes downloads/, those episode files are written into Documents/downloads (same names overwritten; other local files are left). Catalog-only backups still need re-download for missing media. Keychain passwords/keys are not replaced. Local-folder bookmarks may need re-picking on another device. This cannot be undone except by importing another backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This replaces subscriptions, queue, playback, favorites, archive, bookmarks, private episode notes, tags, feed settings, download catalog, download error log, local-folder bookmarks, Settings prefs, and gpodder sync prefs with the backup. If the ZIP includes downloads/, those episode files are written into Documents/downloads (same names overwritten; other local files are left). Catalog-only backups still need re-download for missing media. Keychain passwords/keys are not replaced. Local-folder bookmarks may need re-picking on another device. This cannot be undone except by importing another backup."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ersetzt Abonnements, Warteschlange, Wiedergabe, Favoriten, Archiv, Lesezeichen, private Episoden-Notizen, Tags, Feed-Einstellungen, Download-Katalog, Download-Fehlerprotokoll, Lesezeichen für lokale Ordner, Einstellungen und gpodder-Sync-Einstellungen durch das Backup. Wenn die ZIP downloads/ enthält, werden diese Episodendateien nach Documents/downloads geschrieben (gleiche Namen überschrieben; andere lokale Dateien bleiben). Katalog-only-Backups brauchen fehlende Medien erneut. Keychain-Passwörter/Schlüssel werden nicht ersetzt. Lesezeichen für lokale Ordner müssen auf einem anderen Gerät ggf. neu gewählt werden. Nicht rückgängig außer durch ein anderes Backup."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Deletes %lld played offline file(s) (%@). Keeps unplayed downloads and favorites. Played episodes that are still queued can lose their offline file while staying in the queue. Does not mark unplayed, clear the queue, or delete all downloads.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deletes %lld played offline file(s) (%@). Keeps unplayed downloads and favorites. Played episodes that are still queued can lose their offline file while staying in the queue. Does not mark unplayed, clear the queue, or delete all downloads."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Löscht %lld gehörte Offline-Datei(en) (%@). Behält ungehörte Downloads und Favoriten. Gehörte Episoden, die noch in der Warteschlange sind, können ihre Offline-Datei verlieren und bleiben trotzdem in der Warteschlange. Markiert nicht als ungehört, leert die Warteschlange nicht und löscht nicht alle Downloads."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Deletes %lld completed offline file(s) (%@), including favorited downloads. Uses the full Downloads catalog — not the chip/search filter. Queued episodes and the episode playing from a download can lose their offline file (queue membership stays; playback continues from the stream). Local files only — keeps played status, queue membership, favorites, archive state, and history. Distinct from Delete played downloads and from Clear queue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deletes %lld completed offline file(s) (%@), including favorited downloads. Uses the full Downloads catalog — not the chip/search filter. Queued episodes and the episode playing from a download can lose their offline file (queue membership stays; playback continues from the stream). Local files only — keeps played status, queue membership, favorites, archive state, and history. Distinct from Delete played downloads and from Clear queue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Löscht %lld fertige Offline-Datei(en) (%@), einschließlich favorisierter Downloads. Nutzt den vollständigen Downloads-Katalog — nicht den Chip-/Suchfilter. Episoden in der Warteschlange und die aus einem Download spielende Episode können ihre Offline-Datei verlieren (Warteschlangen-Mitgliedschaft bleibt; Wiedergabe läuft vom Stream weiter). Nur lokale Dateien — behält Gehört-Status, Warteschlangen-Mitgliedschaft, Favoriten, Archiv und Verlauf. Unterschiedlich von Gehörte Downloads löschen und Warteschlange leeren."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Deletes %lld completed offline file(s) (%@), including favorited downloads. Uses the full Downloads catalog. Queued episodes and the episode playing from a download can lose their offline file (queue membership stays; playback continues from the stream). Local files only — keeps played status, queue membership, favorites, archive state, and history. Distinct from Delete played downloads and from Clear queue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deletes %lld completed offline file(s) (%@), including favorited downloads. Uses the full Downloads catalog. Queued episodes and the episode playing from a download can lose their offline file (queue membership stays; playback continues from the stream). Local files only — keeps played status, queue membership, favorites, archive state, and history. Distinct from Delete played downloads and from Clear queue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Löscht %lld fertige Offline-Datei(en) (%@), einschließlich favorisierter Downloads. Nutzt den vollständigen Downloads-Katalog. Episoden in der Warteschlange und die aus einem Download spielende Episode können ihre Offline-Datei verlieren (Warteschlangen-Mitgliedschaft bleibt; Wiedergabe läuft vom Stream weiter). Nur lokale Dateien — behält Gehört-Status, Warteschlangen-Mitgliedschaft, Favoriten, Archiv und Verlauf. Unterschiedlich von Gehörte Downloads löschen und Warteschlange leeren."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Feeds refresh when you pull to refresh (Subscriptions, Home, or Inbox), use Refresh all, or refresh a podcast alone. Bulk refresh skips Keep updated Never; swipe or Feed detail refresh still works for those podcasts. Background App Refresh is not enabled in this beta (Info.plist has no fetch mode).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Feeds refresh when you pull to refresh (Subscriptions, Home, or Inbox), use Refresh all, or refresh a podcast alone. Bulk refresh skips Keep updated Never; swipe or Feed detail refresh still works for those podcasts. Background App Refresh is not enabled in this beta (Info.plist has no fetch mode)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Feeds aktualisieren sich per Pull-to-Refresh (Abos, Home oder Eingang), über Alle aktualisieren oder einzeln. Sammelaktualisierung überspringt Keep updated Nie; Wischen oder Feed-Detail aktualisiert diese Podcasts trotzdem. Background App Refresh ist in dieser Beta nicht aktiv (Info.plist ohne fetch)."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "When you open the app (launch or return to foreground), subscriptions refresh if this interval has elapsed, except podcasts set to Keep updated Never. Same bulk path as Refresh all and pull-to-refresh. Manual single-podcast refresh still works for Never feeds. Background App Refresh is stubbed until Info.plist adds fetch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you open the app (launch or return to foreground), subscriptions refresh if this interval has elapsed, except podcasts set to Keep updated Never. Same bulk path as Refresh all and pull-to-refresh. Manual single-podcast refresh still works for Never feeds. Background App Refresh is stubbed until Info.plist adds fetch."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beim Öffnen der App (Start oder Rückkehr in den Vordergrund) aktualisieren sich Abonnements, wenn dieses Intervall abgelaufen ist — außer Podcasts mit Keep updated Nie. Gleicher Sammelpfad wie Alle aktualisieren und Pull-to-Refresh. Einzelne Podcast-Aktualisierung funktioniert weiterhin bei Nie. Background App Refresh ist stubbed, bis Info.plist fetch ergänzt."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Pull to refresh on Subscriptions, Home, or Inbox, or use Refresh all — Keep updated Never podcasts are skipped. A timed interval also checks when you open the app. iOS Background App Refresh is not enabled in this beta.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pull to refresh on Subscriptions, Home, or Inbox, or use Refresh all — Keep updated Never podcasts are skipped. A timed interval also checks when you open the app. iOS Background App Refresh is not enabled in this beta."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zum Aktualisieren auf Abos, Home oder Eingang ziehen oder Alle aktualisieren nutzen — Podcasts mit Keep updated Nie werden übersprungen. Ein Zeitintervall prüft auch beim Öffnen der App. iOS Background App Refresh ist in dieser Beta nicht aktiv."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Refresh all, pull-to-refresh (Subscriptions, Home, Inbox), and timed Keep updated refresh skip Never. Manual single-podcast refresh (swipe or Feed detail) still works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refresh all, pull-to-refresh (Subscriptions, Home, Inbox), and timed Keep updated refresh skip Never. Manual single-podcast refresh (swipe or Feed detail) still works."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Alle aktualisieren“, Pull-to-Refresh (Abos, Home, Eingang) und zeitgesteuerte Keep-updated-Aktualisierung überspringen „Nie“. Manuelle Einzelaktualisierung (Wischen oder Feed-Detail) funktioniert weiterhin."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Skipped by Refresh all, pull-to-refresh (Subscriptions, Home, Inbox), and timed Keep updated refresh. You can still refresh this podcast alone from Subscriptions (swipe) or Feed detail.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skipped by Refresh all, pull-to-refresh (Subscriptions, Home, Inbox), and timed Keep updated refresh. You can still refresh this podcast alone from Subscriptions (swipe) or Feed detail."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird von „Alle aktualisieren“, Pull-to-Refresh (Abos, Home, Eingang) und zeitgesteuerter Keep-updated-Aktualisierung übersprungen. Du kannst diesen Podcast weiterhin allein über Abonnements (Wischen) oder Feed-Detail aktualisieren."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Included in Refresh all, pull-to-refresh (Subscriptions, Home, Inbox), and timed Keep updated refresh (Subscriptions toolbar, launch/foreground interval). “Always” matches Use global until a global exclude exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Included in Refresh all, pull-to-refresh (Subscriptions, Home, Inbox), and timed Keep updated refresh (Subscriptions toolbar, launch/foreground interval). “Always” matches Use global until a global exclude exists."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enthalten bei „Alle aktualisieren“, Pull-to-Refresh (Abos, Home, Eingang) und zeitgesteuerter Keep-updated-Aktualisierung (Abonnements-Symbolleiste, Start-/Vordergrund-Intervall). „Immer“ entspricht „Global verwenden“, bis es eine globale Ausnahme gibt."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Global Notify on new episodes is the master switch. Per-podcast On is ignored while global is off; per-podcast Off silences that feed when global is on. Local UserNotifications only — no push / APNs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global Notify on new episodes is the master switch. Per-podcast On is ignored while global is off; per-podcast Off silences that feed when global is on. Local UserNotifications only — no push / APNs."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global „Bei neuen Folgen benachrichtigen“ ist der Master-Schalter. Pro-Podcast An wird ignoriert, solange global aus ist; pro-Podcast Aus verstummt diesen Feed, wenn global an ist. Nur lokale UserNotifications — kein Push / APNs."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On for this podcast only while Settings → Notify on new episodes is on (currently %@). Global is master — On does nothing while global is off. System permission still required. Local only — no push.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On for this podcast only while Settings → Notify on new episodes is on (currently %@). Global is master — On does nothing while global is off. System permission still required. Local only — no push."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An für diesen Podcast nur, solange Einstellungen → Bei neuen Folgen benachrichtigen an ist (aktuell %@). Global ist Master — An wirkt nicht, solange global aus ist. Systemberechtigung weiterhin nötig. Nur lokal — kein Push."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Off for this podcast — no local notification, even when Settings → Notify on new episodes is on (currently %@). Local only — no push.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off for this podcast — no local notification, even when Settings → Notify on new episodes is on (currently %@). Local only — no push."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus für diesen Podcast — keine lokale Benachrichtigung, auch wenn Einstellungen → Bei neuen Folgen benachrichtigen an ist (aktuell %@). Nur lokal — kein Push."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Use global. Global Notify on new episodes is on, so this podcast may notify after refresh. System permission still required. Local only — no push.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use global. Global Notify on new episodes is on, so this podcast may notify after refresh. System permission still required. Local only — no push."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global verwenden. Global Bei neuen Folgen benachrichtigen ist an, daher kann dieser Podcast nach dem Aktualisieren benachrichtigen. Systemberechtigung weiterhin nötig. Nur lokal — kein Push."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use global. Global Notify on new episodes is off, so this podcast does not notify. Local only — no push.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use global. Global Notify on new episodes is off, so this podcast does not notify. Local only — no push."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global verwenden. Global Bei neuen Folgen benachrichtigen ist aus, daher benachrichtigt dieser Podcast nicht. Nur lokal — kein Push."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On. Global Notify on new episodes is on, so this podcast may notify after refresh. System permission still required. Local only — no push.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On. Global Notify on new episodes is on, so this podcast may notify after refresh. System permission still required. Local only — no push."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An. Global Bei neuen Folgen benachrichtigen ist an, daher kann dieser Podcast nach dem Aktualisieren benachrichtigen. Systemberechtigung weiterhin nötig. Nur lokal — kein Push."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On. Global Notify on new episodes is off, so On does nothing and this podcast does not notify. Local only — no push.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On. Global Notify on new episodes is off, so On does nothing and this podcast does not notify. Local only — no push."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An. Global Bei neuen Folgen benachrichtigen ist aus, daher bewirkt An nichts und dieser Podcast benachrichtigt nicht. Nur lokal — kein Push."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off. This podcast does not notify, even when Global Notify on new episodes is on. Local only — no push.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off. This podcast does not notify, even when Global Notify on new episodes is on. Local only — no push."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus. Dieser Podcast benachrichtigt nicht, auch wenn Global Bei neuen Folgen benachrichtigen an ist. Nur lokal — kein Push."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When gpodder or Nextcloud login or sync fails, one local banner may open Settings Sync. Banner title is Login failed, Not logged in, or Sync failed — not always Sync failed for login. This toggle does not post a banner by itself and does not start a sync.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When gpodder or Nextcloud login or sync fails, one local banner may open Settings Sync. Banner title is Login failed, Not logged in, or Sync failed — not always Sync failed for login. This toggle does not post a banner by itself and does not start a sync."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn gpodder- oder Nextcloud-Login oder Sync fehlschlägt, kann ein lokaler Banner Einstellungen Sync öffnen. Banner-Titel ist Login fehlgeschlagen, Nicht angemeldet oder Sync fehlgeschlagen — nicht immer Sync fehlgeschlagen bei Login. Dieser Schalter postet keinen Banner von allein und startet keinen Sync."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Sync / login failures → Settings Sync (title Login failed, Not logged in, or Sync failed; short error body)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync / login failures → Settings Sync (title Login failed, Not logged in, or Sync failed; short error body)"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync-/Login-Fehler → Einstellungen Sync (Titel Login fehlgeschlagen, Nicht angemeldet oder Sync fehlgeschlagen; kurze Fehler-Body)"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "When a download fails, one local banner may open Downloads. Title is the episode title, or the podcast title when the episode title is empty, or Download failed. Body is a short error. Successful downloads use the separate download-complete toggle. This toggle does not post a banner by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a download fails, one local banner may open Downloads. Title is the episode title, or the podcast title when the episode title is empty, or Download failed. Body is a short error. Successful downloads use the separate download-complete toggle. This toggle does not post a banner by itself."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn ein Download fehlschlägt, kann ein lokaler Banner Downloads öffnen. Titel ist der Episodentitel, oder der Podcast-Titel wenn der Episodentitel leer ist, oder Download fehlgeschlagen. Body ist ein kurzer Fehler. Erfolgreiche Downloads nutzen den separaten Download-fertig-Schalter. Dieser Schalter postet keinen Banner von allein."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "When a download finishes and the file is saved, one local banner may open Downloads. Title is the episode title, or the podcast title when the episode title is empty, or Download complete. Body is the podcast title when the episode title is present, otherwise Download complete. Cancelled and failed downloads are not included. This toggle does not post a banner by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a download finishes and the file is saved, one local banner may open Downloads. Title is the episode title, or the podcast title when the episode title is empty, or Download complete. Body is the podcast title when the episode title is present, otherwise Download complete. Cancelled and failed downloads are not included. This toggle does not post a banner by itself."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn ein Download fertig ist und die Datei gespeichert wurde, kann ein lokaler Banner Downloads öffnen. Titel ist der Episodentitel, oder der Podcast-Titel wenn der Episodentitel leer ist, oder Download fertig. Body ist der Podcast-Titel wenn ein Episodentitel da ist, sonst Download fertig. Abgebrochene und fehlgeschlagene Downloads sind nicht enthalten. Dieser Schalter postet keinen Banner von allein."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Download failures → Downloads (title = episode, or podcast if episode title empty, or Download failed; body = error)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download failures → Downloads (title = episode, or podcast if episode title empty, or Download failed; body = error)"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download-Fehler → Downloads (Titel = Episode, oder Podcast wenn Episodentitel leer, oder Download fehlgeschlagen; Body = Fehler)"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Download complete → Downloads (title = episode, or podcast if episode title empty, or Download complete; body = feed when episode titled, else Download complete)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download complete → Downloads (title = episode, or podcast if episode title empty, or Download complete; body = feed when episode titled, else Download complete)"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download fertig → Downloads (Titel = Episode, oder Podcast wenn Episodentitel leer, oder Download fertig; Body = Feed wenn Episode betitelt, sonst Download fertig)"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Previous episode": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Previous episode"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vorherige Episode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starts this episode from the beginning": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starts this episode from the beginning"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Startet diese Episode von Anfang an"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the sleep timer pauses or stops playback, a foreground haptic may play if AntennaPod is active, and a local banner may be posted only if iOS permission allows banners. Banner tap opens no screen — not Inbox, Downloads, or Settings. This toggle does not start or end a timer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the sleep timer pauses or stops playback, a foreground haptic may play if AntennaPod is active, and a local banner may be posted only if iOS permission allows banners. Banner tap opens no screen — not Inbox, Downloads, or Settings. This toggle does not start or end a timer."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn der Sleep-Timer die Wiedergabe pausiert oder stoppt, kann eine Vordergrund-Haptik spielen, wenn AntennaPod aktiv ist, und ein lokaler Banner nur, wenn iOS-Berechtigung Banner erlaubt. Tippen auf den Banner öffnet keinen Bildschirm — nicht Eingang, Downloads oder Einstellungen. Dieser Schalter startet oder beendet keinen Timer."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Sleep timer end → local banner + foreground haptic (one per fire; tap opens no screen)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sleep timer end → local banner + foreground haptic (one per fire; tap opens no screen)"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sleep-Timer-Ende → lokaler Banner + Vordergrund-Haptik (eins pro Auslösung; Tippen öffnet keinen Bildschirm)"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "No push / APNs / server-side alerts. Download-complete banners only when that optional toggle is on (default off). No episode-level deep link for new episodes (Inbox only). Sleep timer banner tap opens no screen. Needs an in-app refresh, download, sync, or sleep-timer fire — not a remote push.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No push / APNs / server-side alerts. Download-complete banners only when that optional toggle is on (default off). No episode-level deep link for new episodes (Inbox only). Sleep timer banner tap opens no screen. Needs an in-app refresh, download, sync, or sleep-timer fire — not a remote push."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kein Push / APNs / serverseitige Alerts. Download-fertig-Banner nur wenn dieser optionale Schalter an ist (standardmäßig aus). Kein Folgen-Deep-Link für neue Folgen (nur Eingang). Tippen auf den Sleep-Timer-Banner öffnet keinen Bildschirm. Braucht eine In-App-Aktualisierung, Download, Sync oder Sleep-Timer-Auslösung — kein Remote-Push."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1 new episode": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 new episode"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 neue Episode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New episode": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "New episode"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neue Episode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a successful refresh, one local banner may open Inbox for newly appeared episodes. Title is the podcast name, or New episode / New episodes when the podcast title is empty. Body is the episode title when a single new episode has a title; otherwise a singular or plural count. A per-podcast Off still silences that feed. This toggle does not post a banner by itself and does not download episodes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After a successful refresh, one local banner may open Inbox for newly appeared episodes. Title is the podcast name, or New episode / New episodes when the podcast title is empty. Body is the episode title when a single new episode has a title; otherwise a singular or plural count. A per-podcast Off still silences that feed. This toggle does not post a banner by itself and does not download episodes."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach erfolgreicher Aktualisierung kann ein lokaler Banner den Eingang für neu erschienene Folgen öffnen. Titel ist der Podcast-Name, oder Neue Episode / Neue Episoden wenn der Podcast-Titel leer ist. Body ist der Episodentitel wenn eine einzelne neue Folge einen Titel hat; sonst eine Singular- oder Plural-Anzahl. Pro-Podcast Aus verstummt diesen Feed weiterhin. Dieser Schalter postet keinen Banner von allein und lädt keine Folgen herunter."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "New episodes after refresh (one local banner) → Inbox; title podcast or New episode(s); body episode title or singular/plural count; needs feed refresh + permission": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "New episodes after refresh (one local banner) → Inbox; title podcast or New episode(s); body episode title or singular/plural count; needs feed refresh + permission"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neue Folgen nach Aktualisierung (ein lokaler Banner) → Eingang; Titel Podcast oder Neue Episode(n); Body Episodentitel oder Singular-/Plural-Anzahl; braucht Feed-Aktualisierung + Berechtigung"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "New episodes after refresh (one local banner → Inbox; title podcast or New episode(s); body episode title or count); download failures → Downloads (title episode, or podcast if episode title empty); download complete (optional, default off) → Downloads (title episode, or podcast if episode title empty); sync/login failures → Settings Sync (banner title Login failed, Not logged in, or Sync failed); sleep timer end (banner + foreground haptic; tap opens no screen)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "New episodes after refresh (one local banner → Inbox; title podcast or New episode(s); body episode title or count); download failures → Downloads (title episode, or podcast if episode title empty); download complete (optional, default off) → Downloads (title episode, or podcast if episode title empty); sync/login failures → Settings Sync (banner title Login failed, Not logged in, or Sync failed); sleep timer end (banner + foreground haptic; tap opens no screen)"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neue Folgen nach Aktualisierung (ein lokaler Banner → Eingang; Titel Podcast oder Neue Episode(n); Body Episodentitel oder Anzahl); Download-Fehler → Downloads (Titel Episode, oder Podcast wenn Episodentitel leer); Download fertig (optional, standardmäßig aus) → Downloads (Titel Episode, oder Podcast wenn Episodentitel leer); Sync-/Login-Fehler → Einstellungen Sync (Banner-Titel Login fehlgeschlagen, Nicht angemeldet oder Sync fehlgeschlagen); Sleep-Timer-Ende (Banner + Vordergrund-Haptik; Tippen öffnet keinen Bildschirm)"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "When enabled: new episodes after refresh (one aggregated local banner → Inbox; title podcast or New episode(s); body episode or count), download failures → Downloads, download complete (optional, default off) → Downloads, gpodder/Nextcloud login or sync failures → Settings Sync (banner title Login failed, Not logged in, or Sync failed), and/or sleep timer end (banner + foreground haptic; tap opens no screen). Local only — no push / APNs; iOS Notifications permission required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled: new episodes after refresh (one aggregated local banner → Inbox; title podcast or New episode(s); body episode or count), download failures → Downloads, download complete (optional, default off) → Downloads, gpodder/Nextcloud login or sync failures → Settings Sync (banner title Login failed, Not logged in, or Sync failed), and/or sleep timer end (banner + foreground haptic; tap opens no screen). Local only — no push / APNs; iOS Notifications permission required."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiviert: neue Folgen nach Aktualisierung (ein aggregierter lokaler Banner → Eingang; Titel Podcast oder Neue Episode(n); Body Episode oder Anzahl), Download-Fehler → Downloads, Download fertig (optional, standardmäßig aus) → Downloads, gpodder-/Nextcloud-Login- oder Sync-Fehler → Einstellungen Sync (Banner-Titel Login fehlgeschlagen, Nicht angemeldet oder Sync fehlgeschlagen) und/oder Sleep-Timer-Ende (Banner + Vordergrund-Haptik; Tippen öffnet keinen Bildschirm). Nur lokal — kein Push / APNs; iOS-Benachrichtigungsberechtigung erforderlich."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "No Echo since reset": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Echo since reset"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kein Echo seit dem Zurücksetzen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "History still has older playback, but Echo only counts stamps after the last Statistics Reset. Play again or choose a wider time range. Reset does not clear History.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "History still has older playback, but Echo only counts stamps after the last Statistics Reset. Play again or choose a wider time range. Reset does not clear History."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Verlauf hat noch ältere Wiedergaben, aber Echo zählt nur Zeitstempel nach dem letzten Statistik-Reset. Spiele erneut oder wähle einen größeren Zeitraum. Reset löscht den Verlauf nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No played episodes with a last-played timestamp in this range (and after any Reset baseline). Try All time or another period. Echo uses the same approximate playback data as Statistics.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No played episodes with a last-played timestamp in this range (and after any Reset baseline). Try All time or another period. Echo uses the same approximate playback data as Statistics."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keine gehörten Episoden mit Zuletzt-gespielt-Zeitstempel in diesem Zeitraum (und nach einer Reset-Basislinie). Versuche Gesamt oder einen anderen Zeitraum. Echo nutzt dieselben ungefähren Wiedergabedaten wie Statistik."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "All saved played episodes and favorites in playback.json / favorites.json since first progress or last Statistics Reset. Calendar follows the device. Shared with Statistics.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All saved played episodes and favorites in playback.json / favorites.json since first progress or last Statistics Reset. Calendar follows the device. Shared with Statistics."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alle gespeicherten gehörten Episoden und Favoriten in playback.json / favorites.json seit dem ersten Fortschritt oder dem letzten Statistik-Reset. Kalender folgt dem Gerät. Geteilt mit Statistik."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Allows drag reorder, Shuffle, Shuffle keep playing first, Reverse order, Sort by date, Sort by duration, Sort by title, Move playing to top, Move playing to bottom, and Move to top or bottom. Clear queue, Play random, Mark all as played or unplayed, Archive all, Copy queue, Share queue, Play Next, and adding episodes to the queue already work while locked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allows drag reorder, Shuffle, Shuffle keep playing first, Reverse order, Sort by date, Sort by duration, Sort by title, Move playing to top, Move playing to bottom, and Move to top or bottom. Clear queue, Play random, Mark all as played or unplayed, Archive all, Copy queue, Share queue, Play Next, and adding episodes to the queue already work while locked."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ermöglicht Ziehen-Neuordnen, Mischen, Mischen Wiedergabe zuerst, Umkehren, Nach Datum sortieren, Nach Dauer sortieren, Nach Titel sortieren, Aktuelle Wiedergabe an den Anfang, Aktuelle Wiedergabe an das Ende und An Anfang/Ende. Warteschlange leeren, Zufällig abspielen, Alle als gehört oder ungehört markieren, Alle archivieren, Warteschlange kopieren, Warteschlange teilen, Als Nächstes spielen und Episoden zur Warteschlange hinzufügen funktionieren bereits bei gesperrter Warteschlange."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disables drag reorder, Shuffle, Shuffle keep playing first, Reverse order, Sort by date, Sort by duration, Sort by title, Move playing to top, Move playing to bottom, and Move to top or bottom. Does not block Clear queue, Play random, Mark all as played or unplayed, Archive all, Copy queue, Share queue, Play Next, or adding episodes to the queue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disables drag reorder, Shuffle, Shuffle keep playing first, Reverse order, Sort by date, Sort by duration, Sort by title, Move playing to top, Move playing to bottom, and Move to top or bottom. Does not block Clear queue, Play random, Mark all as played or unplayed, Archive all, Copy queue, Share queue, Play Next, or adding episodes to the queue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deaktiviert Ziehen-Neuordnen, Mischen, Mischen Wiedergabe zuerst, Umkehren, Nach Datum sortieren, Nach Dauer sortieren, Nach Titel sortieren, Aktuelle Wiedergabe an den Anfang, Aktuelle Wiedergabe an das Ende und An Anfang/Ende. Blockiert nicht Warteschlange leeren, Zufällig abspielen, Alle als gehört oder ungehört markieren, Alle archivieren, Warteschlange kopieren, Warteschlange teilen, Als Nächstes spielen oder Episoden zur Warteschlange hinzufügen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lists chapters for this episode; tap a chapter to seek. A chapter start at or past a known duration finishes the episode the same way as a forward skip.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lists chapters for this episode; tap a chapter to seek. A chapter start at or past a known duration finishes the episode the same way as a forward skip."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Listet Kapitel für diese Episode; Tippen sucht zum Kapitel. Ein Kapitelbeginn bei oder nach bekannter Episodendauer beendet die Episode genauso wie Vorspulen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removes all bookmarks for this episode after confirmation. Does not affect other episodes, chapters, Share with position, this episode’s private note, playback, favorites, or the queue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
