    "Reset Statistics baseline. Copy and Share appear when this time range has totals to export.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reset Statistics baseline. Copy and Share appear when this time range has totals to export."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Statistik-Basislinie zurücksetzen. Kopieren und Teilen erscheinen, wenn dieser Zeitraum Summen zum Exportieren hat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks for confirmation, then sets a baseline so Statistics and Echo count only episodes last touched after now. Does not clear History, progress, played flags, downloads, queue, or favorites. Filters playback.json stamps — unlike Android there is no separate played-duration counter. Episodes last played before the reset reappear only when played again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asks for confirmation, then sets a baseline so Statistics and Echo count only episodes last touched after now. Does not clear History, progress, played flags, downloads, queue, or favorites. Filters playback.json stamps — unlike Android there is no separate played-duration counter. Episodes last played before the reset reappear only when played again."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fragt nach Bestätigung und setzt dann eine Basislinie, sodass Statistik und Echo nur Episoden zählen, die danach zuletzt berührt wurden. Löscht nicht Verlauf, Fortschritt, Gehört-Markierungen, Downloads, Warteschlange oder Favoriten. Filtert playback.json-Zeitstempel — anders als Android gibt es keinen separaten Abspieldauer-Zähler. Vor dem Reset zuletzt gehörte Episoden erscheinen erst wieder, wenn sie erneut abgespielt werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chooses which period Statistics and Echo show together. Shared setting. Uses the device calendar. Optional Reset baseline still applies.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chooses which period Statistics and Echo show together. Shared setting. Uses the device calendar. Optional Reset baseline still applies."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wählt, welchen Zeitraum Statistik und Echo gemeinsam anzeigen. Geteilte Einstellung. Nutzt den Gerätekalender. Optionale Zurücksetzen-Basislinie gilt weiterhin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Episodes with saved playback progress that are not marked played. Same time range and Reset baseline as Totals. Their saved position contributes to Approx. listening time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
