          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloads this episode for offline playback. No confirmation. Manual download Wi‑Fi only, parallel-download cap, and storage limit still apply when enabled.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloads this episode for offline playback. No confirmation. Manual download Wi‑Fi only, parallel-download cap, and storage limit still apply when enabled."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lädt diese Episode für die Offline-Wiedergabe herunter. Keine Bestätigung. Manueller Download nur über WLAN; Parallel-Download-Obergrenze und Speicherlimit gelten weiterhin, wenn aktiviert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds this episode to the end of the queue. No confirmation. Queue lock does not block enqueue. Does not start download or mark played.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adds this episode to the end of the queue. No confirmation. Queue lock does not block enqueue. Does not start download or mark played."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reiht diese Episode am Ende der Warteschlange ein. Keine Bestätigung. Warteschlangen-Sperre blockiert das Einreihen nicht. Startet keinen Download und markiert nicht als gehört."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removes Podcast Index API key and secret from the Keychain immediately. No confirmation. Podcast Index search in Add podcast stops working until you save new keys. Does not affect Apple charts, subscriptions, or already saved feeds.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removes Podcast Index API key and secret from the Keychain immediately. No confirmation. Podcast Index search in Add podcast stops working until you save new keys. Does not affect Apple charts, subscriptions, or already saved feeds."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entfernt Podcast-Index-API-Schlüssel und -Geheimnis sofort aus dem Keychain. Keine Bestätigung. Die Podcast-Index-Suche unter Podcast hinzufügen funktioniert erst wieder, wenn du neue Schlüssel speicherst. Betrifft nicht Apple-Charts, Abos oder bereits gespeicherte Feeds."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removes HTTP Basic credentials for this podcast from the Keychain immediately. No confirmation. Private feed refresh and matching-host downloads for this podcast stop authenticating until you save again. Does not affect other podcasts, Podcast Index keys, subscriptions, or offline files.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removes HTTP Basic credentials for this podcast from the Keychain immediately. No confirmation. Private feed refresh and matching-host downloads for this podcast stop authenticating until you save again. Does not affect other podcasts, Podcast Index keys, subscriptions, or offline files."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entfernt die HTTP-Basic-Zugangsdaten für diesen Podcast sofort aus dem Keychain. Keine Bestätigung. Private Feed-Aktualisierung und Downloads vom gleichen Host authentifizieren sich für diesen Podcast erst wieder, wenn du sie speicherst. Betrifft nicht andere Podcasts, Podcast-Index-Schlüssel, Abos oder Offline-Dateien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Places this episode immediately after the currently playing queue item, or at the head if nothing is playing or current is not queued. Moves it if already queued — no duplicate. No confirmation. Queue lock does not block Play Next. Does not start playback, download, or mark played.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Places this episode immediately after the currently playing queue item, or at the head if nothing is playing or current is not queued. Moves it if already queued — no duplicate. No confirmation. Queue lock does not block Play Next. Does not start playback, download, or mark played."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Platziert diese Episode direkt hinter dem aktuell spielenden Queue-Eintrag, oder an den Anfang, wenn nichts spielt oder das aktuelle nicht in der Queue ist. Verschiebt sie, wenn sie schon in der Queue ist — kein Duplikat. Keine Bestätigung. Die Queue-Sperre blockiert Play Next nicht. Startet weder Wiedergabe noch Download und markiert nicht als gehört."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancels this waiting download immediately. No confirmation. Does not delete completed offline files, and does not affect played status, queue, favorites, or archive. Distinct from Cancel all downloads and from Delete download.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancels this waiting download immediately. No confirmation. Does not delete completed offline files, and does not affect played status, queue, favorites, or archive. Distinct from Cancel all downloads and from Delete download."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bricht diesen wartenden Download sofort ab. Keine Bestätigung. Löscht keine fertigen Offline-Dateien und ändert weder Gehört-Status, Queue, Favoriten noch Archiv. Unterschiedlich von Alle Downloads abbrechen und von Download löschen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancels this in-progress download immediately. No confirmation. Does not delete completed offline files, and does not affect played status, queue, favorites, or archive. Distinct from Cancel all downloads and from Delete download.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
