          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bricht diesen laufenden Download sofort ab. Keine Bestätigung. Löscht keine fertigen Offline-Dateien und ändert weder Gehört-Status, Queue, Favoriten noch Archiv. Unterschiedlich von Alle Downloads abbrechen und von Download löschen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turns off the active sleep timer immediately, including clock, End of episode, End of chapter, and End of queue. Restores volume if a fade was in progress. No confirmation. Does not pause or stop playback now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turns off the active sleep timer immediately, including clock, End of episode, End of chapter, and End of queue. Restores volume if a fade was in progress. No confirmation. Does not pause or stop playback now."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schaltet den aktiven Sleep-Timer sofort aus — Uhr, Ende der Episode, Ende des Kapitels und Ende der Queue. Stellt die Lautstärke wieder her, wenn ein Fade lief. Keine Bestätigung. Pausiert oder stoppt die Wiedergabe jetzt nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pauses when the current episode ends. No confirmation. Replaces any active clock, End of chapter, or End of queue sleep timer. Does not pause playback now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pauses when the current episode ends. No confirmation. Replaces any active clock, End of chapter, or End of queue sleep timer. Does not pause playback now."
          }
        },
        "de": {
