            "value": "Starts a %lld-minute clock sleep timer. No confirmation. Replaces any active End of episode, End of chapter, or End of queue sleep timer. Does not pause playback now."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Startet einen %lld-Minuten-Uhr-Sleep-Timer. Keine Bestätigung. Ersetzt jeden aktiven Ende-der-Episode-, Ende-des-Kapitels- oder Ende-der-Queue-Sleep-Timer. Pausiert die Wiedergabe jetzt nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens a sheet to set a custom clock sleep timer between 1 and 180 minutes. The timer starts only after you tap Set. Remembers the last Custom value for next time. Does not pause playback now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens a sheet to set a custom clock sleep timer between 1 and 180 minutes. The timer starts only after you tap Set. Remembers the last Custom value for next time. Does not pause playback now."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet ein Sheet, um einen eigenen Uhr-Sleep-Timer zwischen 1 und 180 Minuten festzulegen. Der Timer startet erst, wenn du auf Setzen tippst. Merkt sich den letzten Custom-Wert für das nächste Mal. Pausiert die Wiedergabe jetzt nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removes the local private note for this episode immediately. No confirmation. Local only — not RSS / gpodder / OPML. Does not affect bookmarks, chapters, Share with position, playback, favorites, feed private notes, or the queue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
