          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens a field to change or clear this bookmark’s note. No confirmation to open. Position stays the same. Local only — not synced via gpodder. Does not change playback, other bookmarks, chapters, Share with position, private notes, favorites, or the queue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens a field to change or clear this bookmark’s note. No confirmation to open. Position stays the same. Local only — not synced via gpodder. Does not change playback, other bookmarks, chapters, Share with position, private notes, favorites, or the queue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet ein Feld, um die Notiz dieses Lesezeichens zu ändern oder zu löschen. Keine Bestätigung zum Öffnen. Die Position bleibt gleich. Nur lokal — nicht über gpodder synchronisiert. Ändert weder Wiedergabe, andere Lesezeichen, Kapitel, Teilen mit Position, private Notizen, Favoriten noch die Queue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copies the full chapter table of contents to the pasteboard. Ignores the chapters search filter. Does not fetch remote or media chapters.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
