          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the system share sheet with the episode title and best network link (episode page, enclosure, feed homepage, or feed URL). Local file URLs are not shared. Does not include a playback position — use Share with position for that.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens the system share sheet with the episode title and best network link (episode page, enclosure, feed homepage, or feed URL). Local file URLs are not shared. Does not include a playback position — use Share with position for that."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet das System-Teilen-Sheet mit Episodentitel und dem besten Netzwerklink (Episodenseite, Enclosure, Feed-Homepage oder Feed-URL). Lokale Datei-URLs werden nicht geteilt. Enthält keine Wiedergabeposition — dafür Teilen mit Position nutzen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the system share sheet with the episode title, best network link (episode page, enclosure, feed homepage, or feed URL), and a readable position timestamp in the message. Local file URLs are not shared. The shared link is unchanged — no #t= seek fragment.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens the system share sheet with the episode title, best network link (episode page, enclosure, feed homepage, or feed URL), and a readable position timestamp in the message. Local file URLs are not shared. The shared link is unchanged — no #t= seek fragment."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet das System-Teilen-Sheet mit Episodentitel, bestem Netzwerklink (Episodenseite, Enclosure, Feed-Homepage oder Feed-URL) und einer lesbaren Positionszeit im Text. Lokale Datei-URLs werden nicht geteilt. Der geteilte Link bleibt unverändert — kein #t=-Seek-Fragment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens a sheet to set a custom session playback speed from 0.50× to 3.00×. Speed applies only after you confirm. Optional Also set as default. Does not change a per-podcast speed override by itself. Not Volume boost or Preserve pitch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens a sheet to set a custom session playback speed from 0.50× to 3.00×. Speed applies only after you confirm. Optional Also set as default. Does not change a per-podcast speed override by itself. Not Volume boost or Preserve pitch."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet ein Sheet, um eine eigene Sitzungs-Wiedergabegeschwindigkeit von 0,50× bis 3,00× festzulegen. Die Geschwindigkeit gilt erst nach Bestätigung. Optional Auch als Standard setzen. Ändert allein keinen Podcast-Geschwindigkeits-Override. Nicht Lautstärke-Boost oder Tonhöhe beibehalten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sets this preset as the session playback speed immediately. No confirmation. Does not change Default speed or this podcast’s speed override. Not Volume boost or Preserve pitch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sets this preset as the session playback speed immediately. No confirmation. Does not change Default speed or this podcast’s speed override. Not Volume boost or Preserve pitch."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Setzt diesen voreingestellten Wert sofort als Sitzungs-Wiedergabegeschwindigkeit. Keine Bestätigung. Ändert weder Standardgeschwindigkeit noch den Podcast-Geschwindigkeits-Override. Nicht Lautstärke-Boost oder Tonhöhe beibehalten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, Set also saves this value as the global Default speed for new episodes. Does not change a per-podcast speed override. Session rate still applies only when you tap Set. Not Volume boost or Preserve pitch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, Set also saves this value as the global Default speed for new episodes. Does not change a per-podcast speed override. Session rate still applies only when you tap Set. Not Volume boost or Preserve pitch."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, speichert Setzen diesen Wert auch als globale Standardgeschwindigkeit für neue Episoden. Ändert keinen Podcast-Geschwindigkeits-Override. Die Sitzungsrate gilt weiterhin erst, wenn du auf Setzen tippst. Nicht Lautstärke-Boost oder Tonhöhe beibehalten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clears the local nickname immediately and shows the feed title from RSS again. No confirmation. Local only — does not change the RSS title, tags, pin, private note, or subscriptions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clears the local nickname immediately and shows the feed title from RSS again. No confirmation. Local only — does not change the RSS title, tags, pin, private note, or subscriptions."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Löscht den lokalen Spitznamen sofort und zeigt wieder den Feed-Titel aus dem RSS. Keine Bestätigung. Nur lokal — ändert weder den RSS-Titel noch Tags, Pin, private Notiz oder Abos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stores the API key and secret in the Keychain on this device immediately. No confirmation. Enables Podcast Index search in Add podcast. Does not affect Apple charts, subscriptions, or already saved feeds.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stores the API key and secret in the Keychain on this device immediately. No confirmation. Enables Podcast Index search in Add podcast. Does not affect Apple charts, subscriptions, or already saved feeds."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speichert API-Schlüssel und -Geheimnis sofort im Keychain auf diesem Gerät. Keine Bestätigung. Aktiviert die Podcast-Index-Suche unter Podcast hinzufügen. Betrifft nicht Apple-Charts, Abos oder bereits gespeicherte Feeds."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stores username and password in the Keychain for this podcast immediately. No confirmation. Enables private feed refresh and matching-host downloads for this podcast. Does not affect other podcasts, Podcast Index keys, subscriptions, or offline files.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stores username and password in the Keychain for this podcast immediately. No confirmation. Enables private feed refresh and matching-host downloads for this podcast. Does not affect other podcasts, Podcast Index keys, subscriptions, or offline files."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speichert Benutzername und Passwort sofort im Keychain für diesen Podcast. Keine Bestätigung. Aktiviert private Feed-Aktualisierung und Downloads vom gleichen Host für diesen Podcast. Betrifft nicht andere Podcasts, Podcast-Index-Schlüssel, Abos oder Offline-Dateien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows fields to paste a new Podcast Index API key and secret. No confirmation. Does not remove the saved Keychain credentials until you Save new keys or Clear keys. Podcast Index search keeps working until then.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows fields to paste a new Podcast Index API key and secret. No confirmation. Does not remove the saved Keychain credentials until you Save new keys or Clear keys. Podcast Index search keeps working until then."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zeigt Felder zum Einfügen eines neuen Podcast-Index-API-Schlüssels und -Geheimnisses. Keine Bestätigung. Entfernt die gespeicherten Keychain-Zugangsdaten erst, wenn du neue Schlüssel speicherst oder Schlüssel löschen nutzt. Die Podcast-Index-Suche funktioniert bis dahin weiter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens a sheet to set a custom playback speed for this podcast from 0.50× to 3.00×. Speed applies only after you confirm. Applied on a fresh episode start and immediately if an episode from this podcast is already playing. Does not rewrite the global Default speed alone. Not Volume boost or Preserve pitch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens a sheet to set a custom playback speed for this podcast from 0.50× to 3.00×. Speed applies only after you confirm. Applied on a fresh episode start and immediately if an episode from this podcast is already playing. Does not rewrite the global Default speed alone. Not Volume boost or Preserve pitch."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet ein Sheet, um eine eigene Wiedergabegeschwindigkeit für diesen Podcast von 0,50× bis 3,00× festzulegen. Die Geschwindigkeit gilt erst nach Bestätigung. Wird beim frischen Episodenstart und sofort angewendet, wenn bereits eine Episode dieses Podcasts spielt. Ändert allein nicht die globale Standardgeschwindigkeit. Nicht Lautstärke-Boost oder Tonhöhe beibehalten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use global or a per-podcast override. Applied on a fresh start (position near 0). Changing this does not seek now, start playback, or download. Distinct from Skip outro, Rewind, and Fast-forward.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use global or a per-podcast override. Applied on a fresh start (position near 0). Changing this does not seek now, start playback, or download. Distinct from Skip outro, Rewind, and Fast-forward."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global oder Podcast-Override. Wird bei einem frischen Start angewendet (Position nahe 0). Ändern sucht jetzt nicht, startet keine Wiedergabe und lädt nichts. Unterschiedlich von Skip Outro, Zurückspulen und Vorspulen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use global or a per-podcast override. Near end, remaining within the value finishes the episode like a natural end when duration is known. Changing this does not mark played now, seek, or download. Distinct from Skip intro and Smart mark as played.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use global or a per-podcast override. Near end, remaining within the value finishes the episode like a natural end when duration is known. Changing this does not mark played now, seek, or download. Distinct from Skip intro and Smart mark as played."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global oder Podcast-Override. Gegen Ende beendet verbleibende Zeit innerhalb des Werts die Episode wie ein natürliches Ende, wenn die Dauer bekannt ist. Ändern markiert jetzt nicht gehört, sucht nicht und lädt nichts. Unterschiedlich von Skip Intro und Intelligent als gehört markieren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use global, Always, or Never for newly appeared episodes after refresh for this podcast. Cap and Wi‑Fi-only still apply globally. Always enqueues even when global Auto-download is off; Never never auto-downloads even when global is on. New episodes Add to Queue and download still enqueues but does not download when Never. Manual Download still works. Changing this does not download or delete now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use global, Always, or Never for newly appeared episodes after refresh for this podcast. Cap and Wi‑Fi-only still apply globally. Always enqueues even when global Auto-download is off; Never never auto-downloads even when global is on. New episodes Add to Queue and download still enqueues but does not download when Never. Manual Download still works. Changing this does not download or delete now."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global, Immer oder Nie für neu erschienene Episoden nach dem Refresh für diesen Podcast. Cap und Nur-Wi‑Fi gelten weiter global. Immer reiht auch ein, wenn globaler Auto-Download aus ist; Nie lädt nie automatisch, auch wenn global an ist. Neue Episoden „Zur Warteschlange hinzufügen und herunterladen“ reiht bei Nie weiterhin ein, lädt aber nicht herunter. Manueller Download funktioniert weiter. Ändern lädt oder löscht jetzt nichts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use global, Inbox only, or Add to Queue for newly appeared episodes of this podcast. Queue and download is only a global choice. Inbox only keeps them out of Queue even when global adds to Queue. Add to Queue does not auto-download from this override; Inbox still lists them while unplayed. Changing this does not move or download existing episodes now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use global, Inbox only, or Add to Queue for newly appeared episodes of this podcast. Queue and download is only a global choice. Inbox only keeps them out of Queue even when global adds to Queue. Add to Queue does not auto-download from this override; Inbox still lists them while unplayed. Changing this does not move or download existing episodes now."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global, Nur Posteingang oder Zur Warteschlange hinzufügen für neu erschienene Episoden dieses Podcasts. „Zur Warteschlange hinzufügen und herunterladen“ gibt es nur als globale Auswahl. Nur Posteingang hält sie aus der Warteschlange, auch wenn global hinzufügt. Zur Warteschlange hinzufügen lädt durch diese Ausnahme nicht automatisch; der Posteingang zeigt sie weiter, solange ungehört. Ändern verschiebt oder lädt bestehende Episoden jetzt nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use global, a preset, or pick Custom… for this podcast’s playback speed. Applied on a fresh episode start and immediately when you change this while an episode from this podcast is playing. Player speed controls stay session-only and do not rewrite this override. Does not rewrite the global Default speed alone. Not Volume boost or Preserve pitch. Changing a preset does not seek or mark played.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use global, a preset, or pick Custom… for this podcast’s playback speed. Applied on a fresh episode start and immediately when you change this while an episode from this podcast is playing. Player speed controls stay session-only and do not rewrite this override. Does not rewrite the global Default speed alone. Not Volume boost or Preserve pitch. Changing a preset does not seek or mark played."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global, eine Vorgabe oder Benutzerdefiniert… für die Wiedergabegeschwindigkeit dieses Podcasts. Gilt bei frischem Episodenstart und sofort, wenn Sie dies ändern, während eine Episode dieses Podcasts spielt. Player-Geschwindigkeitsregler bleiben nur für die Sitzung und schreiben diese Ausnahme nicht um. Schreibt die globale Standardgeschwindigkeit nicht allein um. Nicht Lautstärke-Verstärkung oder Tonhöhe beibehalten. Eine Vorgabe ändern sucht nicht und markiert nicht als gehört."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use global, Always, or Never for deleting this podcast’s offline file when an episode is marked played. Always deletes even when the global toggle is off; Never never auto-deletes even when global is on. Favorites still keep their offline files. Defers while that local file is the active player item. Manual Delete download still works. Changing this does not delete files now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use global, Always, or Never for deleting this podcast’s offline file when an episode is marked played. Always deletes even when the global toggle is off; Never never auto-deletes even when global is on. Favorites still keep their offline files. Defers while that local file is the active player item. Manual Delete download still works. Changing this does not delete files now."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global, Immer oder Nie: Offline-Datei dieses Podcasts löschen, wenn eine Episode als gehört markiert wird. Immer löscht auch, wenn der globale Schalter aus ist; Nie löscht nie automatisch, auch wenn global an ist. Favoriten behalten ihre Offline-Dateien. Verschiebt das Löschen, solange diese lokale Datei das aktive Player-Element ist. Manuelles Download löschen funktioniert weiter. Ändern löscht jetzt keine Dateien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, pins this podcast above unpinned ones on Subscriptions for every sort (Recently updated, Alphabetical, and others). Not a separate sort mode. Local preference only — not synced to gpodder. Included in iOS JSON backup with other feed settings. Cleared when you unsubscribe. Does not unsubscribe, change tags, or change the Subscriptions sort preference. Toggles immediately. No confirmation.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, pins this podcast above unpinned ones on Subscriptions for every sort (Recently updated, Alphabetical, and others). Not a separate sort mode. Local preference only — not synced to gpodder. Included in iOS JSON backup with other feed settings. Cleared when you unsubscribe. Does not unsubscribe, change tags, or change the Subscriptions sort preference. Toggles immediately. No confirmation."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn an, heftet diesen Podcast über nicht angeheftete in Abonnements für jede Sortierung (Zuletzt aktualisiert, Alphabetisch und andere). Keine eigene Sortierart. Nur lokale Einstellung — nicht mit gpodder synchronisiert. Im iOS-JSON-Backup mit anderen Feed-Einstellungen enthalten. Wird beim Abbestellen gelöscht. Kündigt nicht ab, ändert keine Tags und keine Abonnement-Sortierung. Schaltet sofort um. Keine Bestätigung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resets this podcast’s overrides to Use global immediately — Auto-download, Delete after playing, Keep updated, New episodes, Notify, Skip intro, Skip outro, Playback speed, Episode sort, Display name, Private note, and Keep at top. No confirmation. Does not remove tags, clear HTTP Basic authentication, unsubscribe, delete downloads, or change the queue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resets this podcast’s overrides to Use global immediately — Auto-download, Delete after playing, Keep updated, New episodes, Notify, Skip intro, Skip outro, Playback speed, Episode sort, Display name, Private note, and Keep at top. No confirmation. Does not remove tags, clear HTTP Basic authentication, unsubscribe, delete downloads, or change the queue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Setzt die Ausnahmen dieses Podcasts sofort auf Global zurück — Automatischer Download, Nach dem Abspielen löschen, Aktualisiert halten, Neue Episoden, Benachrichtigen, Intro überspringen, Outro überspringen, Wiedergabegeschwindigkeit, Episodensortierung, Anzeigename, Private Notiz und Oben halten. Keine Bestätigung. Entfernt keine Tags, löscht keine HTTP-Basic-Authentifizierung, kündigt nicht ab, löscht keine Downloads und ändert die Warteschlange nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use global, Always, or Never. Never skips Refresh all, pull-to-refresh (Subscriptions, Home, Inbox), and timed Keep updated refresh (Subscriptions toolbar, launch/foreground interval). Always matches Use global until a global exclude exists. Manual single-podcast refresh from Subscriptions swipe or Feed detail still works. Changing this does not refresh now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use global, Always, or Never. Never skips Refresh all, pull-to-refresh (Subscriptions, Home, Inbox), and timed Keep updated refresh (Subscriptions toolbar, launch/foreground interval). Always matches Use global until a global exclude exists. Manual single-podcast refresh from Subscriptions swipe or Feed detail still works. Changing this does not refresh now."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global, Immer oder Nie. Nie überspringt Alle aktualisieren, Pull-to-Refresh (Abonnements, Start, Posteingang) und zeitgesteuertes Aktualisiert-halten (Abonnements-Toolbar, Start-/Vordergrundintervall). Immer entspricht Global, bis es eine globale Ausnahme gibt. Manuelles Aktualisieren einzelner Podcasts per Abonnements-Wisch oder Feed-Detail funktioniert weiter. Ändern aktualisiert jetzt nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assigns this existing tag to this podcast immediately. No confirmation. Tags are local labels that filter Subscriptions — not folders synced to gpodder. A podcast can have several tags. Does not unsubscribe, rename the tag everywhere, delete downloads, or change other podcasts’ tags.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assigns this existing tag to this podcast immediately. No confirmation. Tags are local labels that filter Subscriptions — not folders synced to gpodder. A podcast can have several tags. Does not unsubscribe, rename the tag everywhere, delete downloads, or change other podcasts’ tags."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weist diesen vorhandenen Tag diesem Podcast sofort zu. Keine Bestätigung. Tags sind lokale Bezeichnungen, die Abonnements filtern — keine mit gpodder synchronisierten Ordner. Ein Podcast kann mehrere Tags haben. Kündigt nicht ab, benennt den Tag nicht überall um, löscht keine Downloads und ändert keine Tags anderer Podcasts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe Remove or context menu Remove from podcast unassigns this tag from this podcast immediately. No confirmation. Removing the last use deletes the tag. Context menu Rename applies to every podcast using that name; Delete tag everywhere asks for confirmation. Tags are local Subscriptions filters — not gpodder folders. Does not unsubscribe or delete downloads.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swipe Remove or context menu Remove from podcast unassigns this tag from this podcast immediately. No confirmation. Removing the last use deletes the tag. Context menu Rename applies to every podcast using that name; Delete tag everywhere asks for confirmation. Tags are local Subscriptions filters — not gpodder folders. Does not unsubscribe or delete downloads."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wisch-Entfernen oder Kontextmenü „Von Podcast entfernen“ hebt diesen Tag für diesen Podcast sofort auf. Keine Bestätigung. Die letzte Nutzung löscht den Tag. Kontextmenü Umbenennen gilt für alle Podcasts mit diesem Namen; Tag überall löschen fragt nach Bestätigung. Tags sind lokale Abonnement-Filter — keine gpodder-Ordner. Kündigt nicht ab und löscht keine Downloads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assigns this new tag name to this podcast immediately. No confirmation. Creates the tag in the local vocabulary if it is new. Tags are local labels that filter Subscriptions — not folders synced to gpodder. A podcast can have several tags. Does not unsubscribe, rename other tags, delete downloads, or change other podcasts’ tags.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assigns this new tag name to this podcast immediately. No confirmation. Creates the tag in the local vocabulary if it is new. Tags are local labels that filter Subscriptions — not folders synced to gpodder. A podcast can have several tags. Does not unsubscribe, rename other tags, delete downloads, or change other podcasts’ tags."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weist diesen neuen Tag-Namen diesem Podcast sofort zu. Keine Bestätigung. Legt den Tag in der lokalen Wortliste an, falls er neu ist. Tags sind lokale Bezeichnungen, die Abonnements filtern — keine mit gpodder synchronisierten Ordner. Ein Podcast kann mehrere Tags haben. Kündigt nicht ab, benennt andere Tags nicht um, löscht keine Downloads und ändert keine Tags anderer Podcasts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use global, Newest first, Oldest first, Shortest first, Longest first, Title A–Z, or Title Z–A for this podcast’s episode list only. Feed detail Sort menu saves the same per-podcast override. Serial may auto-set Oldest first once when unset; itunes:type capsule stays display-only. Does not rewrite the global Feed episode sort alone. Changing this does not reorder other podcasts or start a refresh.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use global, Newest first, Oldest first, Shortest first, Longest first, Title A–Z, or Title Z–A for this podcast’s episode list only. Feed detail Sort menu saves the same per-podcast override. Serial may auto-set Oldest first once when unset; itunes:type capsule stays display-only. Does not rewrite the global Feed episode sort alone. Changing this does not reorder other podcasts or start a refresh."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global, Neueste zuerst, Älteste zuerst, Kürzeste zuerst, Längste zuerst, Titel A–Z oder Titel Z–A nur für die Episodenliste dieses Podcasts. Das Sortieren-Menü im Feed-Detail speichert dieselbe Ausnahme pro Podcast. Bei Seriell kann einmal „Älteste zuerst“ gesetzt werden, wenn noch ungesetzt; die itunes:type-Kapsel bleibt nur Anzeige. Schreibt die globale Feed-Episoden-Sortierung nicht allein um. Ändern ordnet andere Podcasts nicht neu und startet keine Aktualisierung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use global, On, or Off. Global Settings → Notify on new episodes is the master switch. Per-podcast Off silences this podcast when global is on; per-podcast On is ignored while global is off. System permission still required. Local UserNotifications only — no push / APNs. Changing this does not send a notification now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use global, On, or Off. Global Settings → Notify on new episodes is the master switch. Per-podcast Off silences this podcast when global is on; per-podcast On is ignored while global is off. System permission still required. Local UserNotifications only — no push / APNs. Changing this does not send a notification now."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global, An oder Aus. Global Einstellungen → Bei neuen Episoden benachrichtigen ist der Master-Schalter. Pro-Podcast Aus verstummt diesen Podcast, wenn global an ist; pro-Podcast An wird ignoriert, solange global aus ist. Systemberechtigung weiterhin nötig. Nur lokale UserNotifications — kein Push / APNs. Ändern sendet jetzt keine Benachrichtigung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orders this podcast’s episode list only: Newest first, Oldest first, Shortest first, Longest first, Title A–Z, or Title Z–A. Saved per podcast — same override as Podcast settings → Episode sort. Serial may auto-set Oldest first once when unset; itunes:type capsule stays display-only. Does not rewrite the global Feed episode sort alone. Changing this does not reorder other podcasts or start a refresh.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Orders this podcast’s episode list only: Newest first, Oldest first, Shortest first, Longest first, Title A–Z, or Title Z–A. Saved per podcast — same override as Podcast settings → Episode sort. Serial may auto-set Oldest first once when unset; itunes:type capsule stays display-only. Does not rewrite the global Feed episode sort alone. Changing this does not reorder other podcasts or start a refresh."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordnet nur die Episodenliste dieses Podcasts: Neueste zuerst, Älteste zuerst, Kürzeste zuerst, Längste zuerst, Titel A–Z oder Titel Z–A. Pro Podcast gespeichert — dieselbe Ausnahme wie Podcast-Einstellungen → Episoden-Sortierung. Bei Seriell kann einmal „Älteste zuerst“ gesetzt werden, wenn noch ungesetzt; die itunes:type-Kapsel bleibt nur Anzeige. Schreibt die globale Feed-Episoden-Sortierung nicht allein um. Ändern ordnet andere Podcasts nicht neu und startet keine Aktualisierung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plays this feed-provided podcast:trailer in the app when the media URL looks playable, starting from the beginning so Skip intro does not clip it. Otherwise opens the URL in the system browser. No confirmation. Distinct from Open trailer. Does not mark played, change the queue, delete downloads, or alter subscriptions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plays this feed-provided podcast:trailer in the app when the media URL looks playable, starting from the beginning so Skip intro does not clip it. Otherwise opens the URL in the system browser. No confirmation. Distinct from Open trailer. Does not mark played, change the queue, delete downloads, or alter subscriptions."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spielt diesen Feed-bereitgestellten podcast:trailer in der App, wenn die Medien-URL abspielbar wirkt, vom Anfang an, damit Intro überspringen ihn nicht abschneidet. Sonst öffnet die URL im Systembrowser. Keine Bestätigung. Unterschiedlich von Trailer öffnen. Markiert nicht als gehört, ändert nicht die Warteschlange, löscht keine Downloads und ändert keine Abonnements."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens this feed-provided podcast:trailer URL in the system browser. Shown when in-app play is not offered for this media URL. No confirmation. Distinct from Play trailer. Does not mark played, change the queue, delete downloads, or alter subscriptions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens this feed-provided podcast:trailer URL in the system browser. Shown when in-app play is not offered for this media URL. No confirmation. Distinct from Play trailer. Does not mark played, change the queue, delete downloads, or alter subscriptions."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet diese Feed-bereitgestellte podcast:trailer-URL im Systembrowser. Wird gezeigt, wenn In-App-Wiedergabe für diese Medien-URL nicht angeboten wird. Keine Bestätigung. Unterschiedlich von Trailer abspielen. Markiert nicht als gehört, ändert nicht die Warteschlange, löscht keine Downloads und ändert keine Abonnements."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pins or unpins this podcast above unpinned ones on Subscriptions for every sort (Recently updated, Alphabetical, and others). Not a separate sort mode. Local preference only — not synced to gpodder. Included in iOS JSON backup with other feed settings. Cleared when you unsubscribe. Does not unsubscribe, change tags, or change the Subscriptions sort preference. Toggles immediately. No confirmation.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pins or unpins this podcast above unpinned ones on Subscriptions for every sort (Recently updated, Alphabetical, and others). Not a separate sort mode. Local preference only — not synced to gpodder. Included in iOS JSON backup with other feed settings. Cleared when you unsubscribe. Does not unsubscribe, change tags, or change the Subscriptions sort preference. Toggles immediately. No confirmation."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Heftet diesen Podcast über nicht angeheftete in Abonnements für jede Sortierung an oder löst ihn (Zuletzt aktualisiert, Alphabetisch und andere). Keine eigene Sortierart. Nur lokale Einstellung — nicht mit gpodder synchronisiert. Im iOS-JSON-Backup mit anderen Feed-Einstellungen enthalten. Wird beim Abbestellen gelöscht. Kündigt nicht ab, ändert keine Tags und keine Abonnement-Sortierung. Schaltet sofort um. Keine Bestätigung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the system share sheet with this feed-provided podcast:trailer media URL. No confirmation. Distinct from Play trailer, Open trailer, and Copy trailer URL. Does not play the trailer, mark played, change the queue, delete downloads, or alter subscriptions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens the system share sheet with this feed-provided podcast:trailer media URL. No confirmation. Distinct from Play trailer, Open trailer, and Copy trailer URL. Does not play the trailer, mark played, change the queue, delete downloads, or alter subscriptions."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet das System-Teilen-Sheet mit dieser Feed-bereitgestellten podcast:trailer-Medien-URL. Keine Bestätigung. Unterschiedlich von Trailer abspielen, Trailer öffnen und Trailer-URL kopieren. Spielt den Trailer nicht ab, markiert nicht als gehört, ändert nicht die Warteschlange, löscht keine Downloads und ändert keine Abonnements."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copies this feed-provided podcast:trailer media URL to the pasteboard. No confirmation. Distinct from Play trailer, Open trailer, and Share trailer URL. Does not play the trailer, mark played, change the queue, delete downloads, or alter subscriptions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copies this feed-provided podcast:trailer media URL to the pasteboard. No confirmation. Distinct from Play trailer, Open trailer, and Share trailer URL. Does not play the trailer, mark played, change the queue, delete downloads, or alter subscriptions."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kopiert diese Feed-bereitgestellte podcast:trailer-Medien-URL in die Zwischenablage. Keine Bestätigung. Unterschiedlich von Trailer abspielen, Trailer öffnen und Trailer-URL teilen. Spielt den Trailer nicht ab, markiert nicht als gehört, ändert nicht die Warteschlange, löscht keine Downloads und ändert keine Abonnements."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, disables the idle timer while audio or video is actively playing so the screen stays awake. Restored when paused, stopped, or no episode. Default off (battery-friendly). Does not override Low Power Mode beyond the idle timer; no brightness changes; Picture in Picture and background audio are unchanged. Changing this does not start or stop playback.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, disables the idle timer while audio or video is actively playing so the screen stays awake. Restored when paused, stopped, or no episode. Default off (battery-friendly). Does not override Low Power Mode beyond the idle timer; no brightness changes; Picture in Picture and background audio are unchanged. Changing this does not start or stop playback."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, deaktiviert den Idle-Timer während aktiver Wiedergabe, damit der Bildschirm wach bleibt. Wiederhergestellt bei Pause, Stopp oder ohne Episode. Standard aus (akkufreundlich). Überschreibt den Energiesparmodus nur beim Idle-Timer; keine Helligkeitsänderung; PiP und Hintergrund-Audio unverändert. Ändern startet oder stoppt die Wiedergabe nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Caps History-listed episodes in playback.json (played / in-progress). Oldest by lastPlayedAt (else updatedAt) are removed first — same as Remove from history (progress and played flags gone). Unlimited keeps the full list. Does not touch favorites, archive, downloads, or queue. Statistics and Continue listening may lose trimmed episodes. Default Unlimited. Changing this does not delete downloads or clear the queue now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caps History-listed episodes in playback.json (played / in-progress). Oldest by lastPlayedAt (else updatedAt) are removed first — same as Remove from history (progress and played flags gone). Unlimited keeps the full list. Does not touch favorites, archive, downloads, or queue. Statistics and Continue listening may lose trimmed episodes. Default Unlimited. Changing this does not delete downloads or clear the queue now."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Begrenzt die im Verlauf gelisteten Episoden in playback.json (gehört / in Bearbeitung). Älteste nach lastPlayedAt (sonst updatedAt) zuerst — wie „Aus Verlauf entfernen“ (Fortschritt und Gehört-Status weg). Unbegrenzt behält die ganze Liste. Favoriten, Archiv, Downloads und Warteschlange bleiben. Statistik und Weitershören können getrimmte Episoden verlieren. Standard: Unbegrenzt. Ändern löscht jetzt keine Downloads und leert die Warteschlange nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, requests mono output (restores stereo when off). Reapplied on play, Settings change, and audio route change. Best-effort — the system may ignore this on some routes (speaker, Bluetooth, CarPlay). Not a true L+R remix; keeps stock AVPlayer. Not Android ExoPlayer stereo→mono. Default off. Changing this does not start or stop playback.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, requests mono output (restores stereo when off). Reapplied on play, Settings change, and audio route change. Best-effort — the system may ignore this on some routes (speaker, Bluetooth, CarPlay). Not a true L+R remix; keeps stock AVPlayer. Not Android ExoPlayer stereo→mono. Default off. Changing this does not start or stop playback."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn an, fordert Mono-Ausgabe an (stellt Stereo wieder her, wenn aus). Wird bei Wiedergabe, Einstellungsänderung und Audio-Routenwechsel erneut angewendet. Best effort — das System kann dies auf manchen Routen ignorieren (Lautsprecher, Bluetooth, CarPlay). Kein echtes L+R-Remix; behält stock AVPlayer. Nicht Android-ExoPlayer Stereo→Mono. Standard aus. Ändern startet oder stoppt die Wiedergabe nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, clock sleep timer lowers player volume over the last ~10 seconds before pause. End of episode or chapter do not fade. Soft player volume only — not equal-loudness or ReplayGain. Volume boost stays separate. Pause, seek, or cancel timer restores pre-fade volume. Default on. Changing this does not start a sleep timer or change playback now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, clock sleep timer lowers player volume over the last ~10 seconds before pause. End of episode or chapter do not fade. Soft player volume only — not equal-loudness or ReplayGain. Volume boost stays separate. Pause, seek, or cancel timer restores pre-fade volume. Default on. Changing this does not start a sleep timer or change playback now."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn an, senkt der Uhr-Schlaf-Timer die Player-Lautstärke über die letzten ~10 Sekunden vor der Pause. Ende der Episode oder des Kapitels fadet nicht. Nur weiche Player-Lautstärke — keine Equal-Loudness oder ReplayGain. Lautstärke-Verstärkung bleibt getrennt. Pause, Seek oder Timer abbrechen stellt die Lautstärke vor dem Fade wieder her. Standard an. Ändern startet keinen Schlaf-Timer und ändert die Wiedergabe jetzt nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, video episodes hide the video surface (artwork instead), disable video tracks, and skip Picture in Picture. Does not remux or strip video from the file; background audio continues; streaming or HLS may still download a video stream. Lockscreen and Now Playing stay audio. Default off. Changing this does not start or stop playback.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, video episodes hide the video surface (artwork instead), disable video tracks, and skip Picture in Picture. Does not remux or strip video from the file; background audio continues; streaming or HLS may still download a video stream. Lockscreen and Now Playing stay audio. Default off. Changing this does not start or stop playback."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn an, blenden Video-Episoden die Videofläche aus (stattdessen Artwork), deaktivieren Videospuren und überspringen Bild-in-Bild. Remuxt oder entfernt Video nicht aus der Datei; Hintergrund-Audio läuft weiter; Streaming oder HLS kann weiterhin einen Videostream laden. Sperrbildschirm und Jetzt läuft bleiben Audio. Standard aus. Ändern startet oder stoppt die Wiedergabe nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copies the feed-provided podcast GUID to the pasteboard as plain text. No confirmation. Distinct from the podcast, feed URL, website, funding, and discussion copies, and from Share podcast GUID. Does not open a link, change subscriptions, or invent a GUID when missing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copies the feed-provided podcast GUID to the pasteboard as plain text. No confirmation. Distinct from the podcast, feed URL, website, funding, and discussion copies, and from Share podcast GUID. Does not open a link, change subscriptions, or invent a GUID when missing."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kopiert die feedseitige Podcast-GUID als reinen Text in die Zwischenablage. Keine Bestätigung. Unterschiedlich vom Kopieren des Podcasts, der Feed-URL, Website, Unterstützung und Diskussion und von Podcast-GUID teilen. Öffnet keinen Link, ändert keine Abonnements und erfindet keine GUID, wenn sie fehlt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens a sheet to set a custom Default speed from 0.50× to 3.00× in 0.05 steps. Speed applies only after you confirm. New episodes start at this speed. Does not change the rate already playing or rewrite a per-podcast speed override. Distinct from player session Custom…. Not Volume boost or Preserve pitch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens a sheet to set a custom Default speed from 0.50× to 3.00× in 0.05 steps. Speed applies only after you confirm. New episodes start at this speed. Does not change the rate already playing or rewrite a per-podcast speed override. Distinct from player session Custom…. Not Volume boost or Preserve pitch."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet ein Sheet, um eine eigene Standardgeschwindigkeit von 0,50× bis 3,00× in 0,05-Schritten festzulegen. Die Geschwindigkeit gilt erst nach Bestätigung. Neue Episoden starten mit dieser Geschwindigkeit. Ändert weder die bereits spielende Rate noch einen Podcast-Geschwindigkeits-Override. Unterschiedlich von Sitzungs-Benutzerdefiniert… im Player. Nicht Lautstärke-Verstärkung oder Tonhöhe beibehalten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clears the mark-played count and Prompt attempted flag immediately. No confirmation. For testing — does not show an App Store rating sheet now, and does not change the Ask for App Store rating toggle.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clears the mark-played count and Prompt attempted flag immediately. No confirmation. For testing — does not show an App Store rating sheet now, and does not change the Ask for App Store rating toggle."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Löscht „Zähler „als gehört markiert““ und „Abfrage versucht“ sofort. Keine Bestätigung. Zum Testen — zeigt jetzt kein App-Store-Bewertungsblatt und ändert nicht „Um App-Store-Bewertung bitten“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, after ten newly marked-played episodes (manual or finished playback), AntennaPod may ask iOS to show a rating sheet once per install. iOS decides whether to show it and may suppress it under system limits — we never spam. Off stops counting toward a prompt. Changing this does not show a rating sheet now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, after ten newly marked-played episodes (manual or finished playback), AntennaPod may ask iOS to show a rating sheet once per install. iOS decides whether to show it and may suppress it under system limits — we never spam. Off stops counting toward a prompt. Changing this does not show a rating sheet now."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn an, kann AntennaPod nach zehn neu als gehört markierten Episoden (manuell oder nach Ende der Wiedergabe) iOS einmal pro Installation um ein Bewertungsblatt bitten. iOS entscheidet, ob es erscheint, und kann es unter Systemgrenzen unterdrücken — wir spammen nie. Aus stoppt das Zählen für eine Abfrage. Ändern zeigt jetzt kein Bewertungsblatt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copies the feed-provided episode media / enclosure http(s) URL to the pasteboard. No confirmation. Hidden for local file or local-folder URLs. Distinct from Copy episode link and Share episode. Does not download, play, mark played, or change the queue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copies the feed-provided episode media / enclosure http(s) URL to the pasteboard. No confirmation. Hidden for local file or local-folder URLs. Distinct from Copy episode link and Share episode. Does not download, play, mark played, or change the queue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kopiert die feedseitige Episoden-Medien-/Enclosure-http(s)-URL in die Zwischenablage. Keine Bestätigung. Verborgen für lokale Datei- oder Lokalordner-URLs. Unterschiedlich von Episodenlink kopieren und Episode teilen. Lädt nicht herunter, spielt nicht ab, markiert nicht als gehört und ändert nicht die Warteschlange."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copies the feed-provided episode webpage http(s) link to the pasteboard. No confirmation. Never silently copies the enclosure as the episode link. Distinct from Copy media URL and Share episode. Does not open the browser, download, play, mark played, or change the queue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copies the feed-provided episode webpage http(s) link to the pasteboard. No confirmation. Never silently copies the enclosure as the episode link. Distinct from Copy media URL and Share episode. Does not open the browser, download, play, mark played, or change the queue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kopiert den feedseitigen Episoden-Webseiten-http(s)-Link in die Zwischenablage. Keine Bestätigung. Kopiert nie stillschweigend die Enclosure als Episodenlink. Unterschiedlich von Medien-URL kopieren und Episode teilen. Öffnet nicht den Browser, lädt nicht herunter, spielt nicht ab, markiert nicht als gehört und ändert nicht die Warteschlange."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the feed-provided episode webpage http(s) link in the system browser — not an in-app WebView. No confirmation. Never uses the enclosure or podcast website URL. Distinct from Copy episode link, Copy media URL, and Share episode. Does not download, play, mark played, or change the queue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens the feed-provided episode webpage http(s) link in the system browser — not an in-app WebView. No confirmation. Never uses the enclosure or podcast website URL. Distinct from Copy episode link, Copy media URL, and Share episode. Does not download, play, mark played, or change the queue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet den feedseitigen Episoden-Webseiten-http(s)-Link im Systembrowser — kein In-App-WebView. Keine Bestätigung. Nutzt nie die Enclosure- oder Podcast-Website-URL. Unterschiedlich von Episodenlink kopieren, Medien-URL kopieren und Episode teilen. Lädt nicht herunter, spielt nicht ab, markiert nicht als gehört und ändert nicht die Warteschlange."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the feed-provided podcast website http(s) link in the system browser — not an in-app WebView. No confirmation. Never uses the feed RSS URL or an episode webpage. Distinct from Open episode website, Copy podcast website, and Share podcast website. Does not subscribe, download, or change playback.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens the feed-provided podcast website http(s) link in the system browser — not an in-app WebView. No confirmation. Never uses the feed RSS URL or an episode webpage. Distinct from Open episode website, Copy podcast website, and Share podcast website. Does not subscribe, download, or change playback."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet den feedseitigen Podcast-Website-http(s)-Link im Systembrowser — kein In-App-WebView. Keine Bestätigung. Nutzt nie die Feed-RSS-URL oder eine Episoden-Webseite. Unterschiedlich von Episoden-Website öffnen, Podcast-Website kopieren und Podcast-Website teilen. Abonniert nicht, lädt nicht herunter und ändert die Wiedergabe nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copies the feed RSS or Atom URL to the pasteboard. No confirmation. Disabled for local-folder podcasts and empty URLs. Distinct from the podcast website, funding, and discussion links, and from Share feed URL. Does not subscribe, refresh, or open a browser.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copies the feed RSS or Atom URL to the pasteboard. No confirmation. Disabled for local-folder podcasts and empty URLs. Distinct from the podcast website, funding, and discussion links, and from Share feed URL. Does not subscribe, refresh, or open a browser."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kopiert die Feed-RSS- oder Atom-URL in die Zwischenablage. Keine Bestätigung. Deaktiviert für Lokalordner-Podcasts und leere URLs. Unterschiedlich von Podcast-Website, Funding- und Diskussionslinks und von Feed-URL teilen. Abonniert nicht, aktualisiert nicht und öffnet keinen Browser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copies the full episode shownotes as plain text with HTML stripped to the pasteboard. Ignores the shownotes search filter. No confirmation. Distinct from Share shownotes. Does not open a browser, download, play, mark played, or change the queue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copies the full episode shownotes as plain text with HTML stripped to the pasteboard. Ignores the shownotes search filter. No confirmation. Distinct from Share shownotes. Does not open a browser, download, play, mark played, or change the queue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kopiert die vollständigen Episoden-Shownotes als Klartext ohne HTML in die Zwischenablage. Ignoriert den Shownotes-Suchfilter. Keine Bestätigung. Unterschiedlich von Shownotes teilen. Öffnet keinen Browser, lädt nicht herunter, spielt nicht ab, markiert nicht als gehört und ändert nicht die Warteschlange."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens a sheet to set a custom Fast-forward interval from 5 to 60 seconds. Interval applies only after you confirm Set. The next fast-forward uses the saved value. Changing this does not move the current position. Distinct from Rewind Custom…. Not Rewind after pause.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens a sheet to set a custom Fast-forward interval from 5 to 60 seconds. Interval applies only after you confirm Set. The next fast-forward uses the saved value. Changing this does not move the current position. Distinct from Rewind Custom…. Not Rewind after pause."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet ein Sheet, um ein eigenes Vorspul-Intervall von 5 bis 60 Sekunden festzulegen. Das Intervall gilt erst nach Bestätigung mit Festlegen. Das nächste Vorspulen nutzt den gespeicherten Wert. Ändern verschiebt die aktuelle Position nicht. Unterschiedlich von Zurückspulen Benutzerdefiniert…. Nicht Zurückspulen nach Pause."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional proxy username for HTTP Basic. Saved in Settings and backup — not the Keychain. Leave empty for no proxy authentication. Pair with Proxy password; the password stays Keychain-only and never in backup.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional proxy username for HTTP Basic. Saved in Settings and backup — not the Keychain. Leave empty for no proxy authentication. Pair with Proxy password; the password stays Keychain-only and never in backup."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optionaler Proxy-Benutzername für HTTP Basic. In Einstellungen und Backup gespeichert — nicht im Schlüsselbund. Leer lassen für keine Proxy-Anmeldung. Zusammen mit Proxy-Passwort; das Passwort bleibt nur im Schlüsselbund und nie im Backup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local banners when gpodder or Nextcloud login or sync fails — may open Settings Sync. Title may be Login failed, Not logged in, or Sync failed. Does not post a banner by itself and does not start a sync. Not push. Successful sync stays silent.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local banners when gpodder or Nextcloud login or sync fails — may open Settings Sync. Title may be Login failed, Not logged in, or Sync failed. Does not post a banner by itself and does not start a sync. Not push. Successful sync stays silent."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lokale Banner bei fehlgeschlagenem gpodder- oder Nextcloud-Login oder -Sync — können Einstellungen Sync öffnen. Titel kann Anmeldung fehlgeschlagen, Nicht angemeldet oder Sync fehlgeschlagen sein. Löst selbst keinen Banner aus und startet keinen Sync. Kein Push. Erfolgreicher Sync bleibt still."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local banners when a download fails — may open Downloads. Title is the episode title, the podcast title when the episode title is empty, or Download failed. Body is a short error. Does not post a banner by itself. Not push. Successful downloads use Notify on download complete. Failures can still appear in Download errors when this is off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local banners when a download fails — may open Downloads. Title is the episode title, the podcast title when the episode title is empty, or Download failed. Body is a short error. Does not post a banner by itself. Not push. Successful downloads use Notify on download complete. Failures can still appear in Download errors when this is off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lokale Banner bei fehlgeschlagenem Download — können Downloads öffnen. Titel ist der Episodentitel, der Podcasttitel wenn der Episodentitel leer ist, oder Download fehlgeschlagen. Text ist ein kurzer Fehler. Löst selbst keinen Banner aus. Kein Push. Erfolgreiche Downloads nutzen Bei Download-Abschluss benachrichtigen. Fehler können bei Aus weiterhin unter Download-Fehler erscheinen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens a sheet to set a custom Rewind interval from 5 to 60 seconds. Interval applies only after you confirm Set. The next rewind uses the saved value. Changing this does not move the current position. Distinct from Fast-forward Custom…. Not Rewind after pause.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens a sheet to set a custom Rewind interval from 5 to 60 seconds. Interval applies only after you confirm Set. The next rewind uses the saved value. Changing this does not move the current position. Distinct from Fast-forward Custom…. Not Rewind after pause."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet ein Sheet, um ein eigenes Zurückspul-Intervall von 5 bis 60 Sekunden festzulegen. Das Intervall gilt erst nach Bestätigung mit Festlegen. Das nächste Zurückspulen nutzt den gespeicherten Wert. Ändern verschiebt die aktuelle Position nicht. Unterschiedlich von Vorspulen Benutzerdefiniert…. Nicht Zurückspulen nach Pause."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local banners when a download finishes and the file is saved — may open Downloads. Title is the episode title, the podcast title when the episode title is empty, or Download complete. Default off. Does not post a banner by itself. Not push. Cancelled and failed downloads are not included; failures use Notify on download errors.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local banners when a download finishes and the file is saved — may open Downloads. Title is the episode title, the podcast title when the episode title is empty, or Download complete. Default off. Does not post a banner by itself. Not push. Cancelled and failed downloads are not included; failures use Notify on download errors."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lokale Banner, wenn ein Download fertig ist und die Datei gespeichert wurde — können Downloads öffnen. Titel ist der Episodentitel, der Podcasttitel wenn der Episodentitel leer ist, oder Download abgeschlossen. Standard aus. Löst selbst keinen Banner aus. Kein Push. Abgebrochene und fehlgeschlagene Downloads zählen nicht; Fehler nutzen Bei Download-Fehlern benachrichtigen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, network streaming needs Wi‑Fi or Ethernet; local offline files still play. Default off. Does not download the episode or start playback. Feed refresh is not limited by this toggle and may use cellular. Not Manual download or Auto-download Wi‑Fi only. No VPN or proxy detection.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, network streaming needs Wi‑Fi or Ethernet; local offline files still play. Default off. Does not download the episode or start playback. Feed refresh is not limited by this toggle and may use cellular. Not Manual download or Auto-download Wi‑Fi only. No VPN or proxy detection."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, braucht Netzwerk-Streaming Wi‑Fi oder Ethernet; lokale Offline-Dateien spielen weiter. Standard aus. Lädt die Episode nicht herunter und startet keine Wiedergabe. Feed-Aktualisierung wird von diesem Schalter nicht begrenzt und darf Mobilfunk nutzen. Nicht Manueller Download nur Wi‑Fi oder Auto-Download nur Wi‑Fi. Keine VPN- oder Proxy-Erkennung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on (default), auto-download after a successful refresh needs Wi‑Fi or Ethernet. Does not start a download by itself. Manual downloads and streaming stay on their own toggles. Feed refresh is not limited by this toggle and may use cellular. Not Manual download or Stream Wi‑Fi only. No VPN or proxy detection.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on (default), auto-download after a successful refresh needs Wi‑Fi or Ethernet. Does not start a download by itself. Manual downloads and streaming stay on their own toggles. Feed refresh is not limited by this toggle and may use cellular. Not Manual download or Stream Wi‑Fi only. No VPN or proxy detection."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv (Standard), braucht Auto-Download nach erfolgreicher Aktualisierung Wi‑Fi oder Ethernet. Startet selbst keinen Download. Manuelle Downloads und Streaming bleiben auf eigenen Schaltern. Feed-Aktualisierung wird von diesem Schalter nicht begrenzt und darf Mobilfunk nutzen. Nicht Manueller Download nur Wi‑Fi oder Stream nur Wi‑Fi. Keine VPN- oder Proxy-Erkennung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, user-started downloads need Wi‑Fi or Ethernet and a download error is recorded on cellular. Default off — manual downloads may use mobile data. Files already saved stay. Does not start a download by itself. Feed refresh is not limited by this toggle and may use cellular. Not Auto-download or Stream Wi‑Fi only. No VPN or proxy detection.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, user-started downloads need Wi‑Fi or Ethernet and a download error is recorded on cellular. Default off — manual downloads may use mobile data. Files already saved stay. Does not start a download by itself. Feed refresh is not limited by this toggle and may use cellular. Not Auto-download or Stream Wi‑Fi only. No VPN or proxy detection."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, brauchen vom Nutzer gestartete Downloads Wi‑Fi oder Ethernet, und bei Mobilfunk wird ein Download-Fehler erfasst. Standard aus — manuelle Downloads dürfen Mobilfunk nutzen. Bereits gespeicherte Dateien bleiben. Startet selbst keinen Download. Feed-Aktualisierung wird von diesem Schalter nicht begrenzt und darf Mobilfunk nutzen. Nicht Auto-Download nur Wi‑Fi oder Stream nur Wi‑Fi. Keine VPN- oder Proxy-Erkennung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saves the Proxy password draft to the Keychain only — never in Settings backup. Disabled while the field is empty. Does not turn on HTTP proxy, test the connection, or change host, port, or username. Clears the draft field after a successful save.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saves the Proxy password draft to the Keychain only — never in Settings backup. Disabled while the field is empty. Does not turn on HTTP proxy, test the connection, or change host, port, or username. Clears the draft field after a successful save."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speichert den Proxy-Passwort-Entwurf nur im Schlüsselbund — nie im Einstellungen-Backup. Deaktiviert, solange das Feld leer ist. Schaltet HTTP-Proxy nicht ein, testet die Verbindung nicht und ändert Host, Port oder Benutzername nicht. Leert das Entwurfsfeld nach erfolgreichem Speichern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removes the stored Proxy password from the Keychain and clears the draft field. Shown only when a password is stored. Does not turn off HTTP proxy, test the connection, or change host, port, or username. Password is never in Settings backup.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removes the stored Proxy password from the Keychain and clears the draft field. Shown only when a password is stored. Does not turn off HTTP proxy, test the connection, or change host, port, or username. Password is never in Settings backup."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entfernt das gespeicherte Proxy-Passwort aus dem Schlüsselbund und leert das Entwurfsfeld. Nur sichtbar, wenn ein Passwort gespeichert ist. Schaltet HTTP-Proxy nicht aus, testet die Verbindung nicht und ändert Host, Port oder Benutzername nicht. Das Passwort liegt nie im Einstellungen-Backup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on and host plus port are valid, URLSession clients (feeds, downloads, search, and similar) use this HTTP(S) proxy. AVPlayer streaming may bypass it. Does not test the connection by itself. Not VPN detection, certificate pinning, or SOCKS. Username and password stay optional.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on and host plus port are valid, URLSession clients (feeds, downloads, search, and similar) use this HTTP(S) proxy. AVPlayer streaming may bypass it. Does not test the connection by itself. Not VPN detection, certificate pinning, or SOCKS. Username and password stay optional."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv und Host sowie Port gültig sind, nutzen URLSession-Clients (Feeds, Downloads, Suche und Ähnliches) diesen HTTP(S)-Proxy. AVPlayer-Streaming kann ihn umgehen. Testet die Verbindung nicht von selbst. Keine VPN-Erkennung, kein Zertifikats-Pinning, kein SOCKS. Benutzername und Passwort bleiben optional."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear download errors": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clear download errors"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download-Fehler löschen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks for confirmation, then clears the full persisted download error log and the Downloads banner — ignores the search filter. Offline downloaded files are kept. Does not cancel active downloads or delete episode media.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asks for confirmation, then clears the full persisted download error log and the Downloads banner — ignores the search filter. Offline downloaded files are kept. Does not cancel active downloads or delete episode media."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fragt nach Bestätigung und löscht dann das gesamte gespeicherte Download-Fehlerprotokoll und das Downloads-Banner — ignoriert den Suchfilter. Offline heruntergeladene Dateien bleiben. Bricht keine laufenden Downloads ab und löscht keine Episoden-Medien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the feed-provided discussion http(s) link in the system browser — not an in-app WebView. No confirmation. Does not post as you. Never uses the feed RSS URL or the podcast website. Distinct from Copy discuss URL, Share discuss URL, and Open podcast website. Does not subscribe, download, or change playback.": {
