            "value": "Opens the feed-provided discussion http(s) link in the system browser — not an in-app WebView. No confirmation. Does not post as you. Never uses the feed RSS URL or the podcast website. Distinct from Copy discuss URL, Share discuss URL, and Open podcast website. Does not subscribe, download, or change playback."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet den vom Feed gelieferten Diskussions-http(s)-Link im Systembrowser — kein In-App-WebView. Keine Bestätigung. Postet nicht in deinem Namen. Nutzt nie die Feed-RSS-URL oder die Podcast-Website. Unterschiedlich von Diskussions-URL kopieren, Diskussions-URL teilen und Podcast-Website öffnen. Abonniert nicht, lädt nicht herunter und ändert die Wiedergabe nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copies the feed-provided discussion URL to the pasteboard. No confirmation. Does not post as you. Never uses the feed RSS URL or the podcast website. Distinct from Discuss, Share discuss URL, and Copy feed URL. Does not open a browser, subscribe, or download.": {
