            "value": "Öffnet das System-Share-Sheet mit der vom Feed gelieferten Funding- oder Support-Seiten-URL. Verarbeitet keine Zahlungen. Nutzt nie die Feed-RSS-URL, die Podcast-Website oder den Diskussionslink. Unterschiedlich vom Öffnen der Funding-Seite, Funding-URL kopieren und Feed-URL teilen. Teilen ist deine Entscheidung und abonniert nicht und lädt nicht herunter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the system share sheet with the feed RSS or Atom URL. Disabled for local-folder podcasts and empty URLs. Distinct from the podcast website, funding, and discussion links, and from Copy feed URL. Sharing is your choice and does not subscribe, refresh, or open a browser.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens the system share sheet with the feed RSS or Atom URL. Disabled for local-folder podcasts and empty URLs. Distinct from the podcast website, funding, and discussion links, and from Copy feed URL. Sharing is your choice and does not subscribe, refresh, or open a browser."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet das System-Share-Sheet mit der RSS- oder Atom-URL des Feeds. Deaktiviert für lokale Ordner-Podcasts und leere URLs. Unterschiedlich von Podcast-Website, Funding- und Diskussionslinks sowie von Feed-URL kopieren. Teilen ist deine Entscheidung und abonniert nicht, aktualisiert nicht und öffnet keinen Browser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the system share sheet with the raw feed URL string when it is not available as a URL object. Disabled for local-folder podcasts and empty URLs. Distinct from the podcast website, funding, and discussion links, and from Copy feed URL. Sharing is your choice and does not subscribe, refresh, or open a browser.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens the system share sheet with the raw feed URL string when it is not available as a URL object. Disabled for local-folder podcasts and empty URLs. Distinct from the podcast website, funding, and discussion links, and from Copy feed URL. Sharing is your choice and does not subscribe, refresh, or open a browser."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet das System-Share-Sheet mit der rohen Feed-URL als Text, wenn keine URL-Objekt-Form verfügbar ist. Deaktiviert für lokale Ordner-Podcasts und leere URLs. Unterschiedlich von Podcast-Website, Funding- und Diskussionslinks sowie von Feed-URL kopieren. Teilen ist deine Entscheidung und abonniert nicht, aktualisiert nicht und öffnet keinen Browser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copies the feed-provided podcast website URL to the pasteboard. No confirmation. Never uses the feed RSS URL, an episode webpage, funding URL, or discussion link. Distinct from Open podcast website, Share podcast website, and Copy feed URL. Does not open a browser, subscribe, or download.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copies the feed-provided podcast website URL to the pasteboard. No confirmation. Never uses the feed RSS URL, an episode webpage, funding URL, or discussion link. Distinct from Open podcast website, Share podcast website, and Copy feed URL. Does not open a browser, subscribe, or download."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kopiert die vom Feed gelieferte Podcast-Website-URL in die Zwischenablage. Keine Bestätigung. Nutzt nie die Feed-RSS-URL, eine Episoden-Webseite, Funding-URL oder den Diskussionslink. Unterschiedlich von Podcast-Website öffnen, Podcast-Website teilen und Feed-URL kopieren. Öffnet keinen Browser, abonniert nicht und lädt nicht herunter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the system share sheet with the feed-provided podcast website URL. Never uses the feed RSS URL, an episode webpage, funding URL, or discussion link. Distinct from Open podcast website, Copy podcast website, and Share feed URL. Sharing is your choice and does not subscribe or download.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens the system share sheet with the feed-provided podcast website URL. Never uses the feed RSS URL, an episode webpage, funding URL, or discussion link. Distinct from Open podcast website, Copy podcast website, and Share feed URL. Sharing is your choice and does not subscribe or download."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet das System-Share-Sheet mit der vom Feed gelieferten Podcast-Website-URL. Nutzt nie die Feed-RSS-URL, eine Episoden-Webseite, Funding-URL oder den Diskussionslink. Unterschiedlich von Podcast-Website öffnen, Podcast-Website kopieren und Feed-URL teilen. Teilen ist deine Entscheidung und abonniert nicht und lädt nicht herunter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local banner and foreground haptic when the sleep timer pauses or stops playback — only if iOS allows banners. Banner tap opens no screen — not Inbox, Downloads, or Settings. Does not start or end a timer by itself. Not push. The sleep timer itself is unchanged when this is off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local banner and foreground haptic when the sleep timer pauses or stops playback — only if iOS allows banners. Banner tap opens no screen — not Inbox, Downloads, or Settings. Does not start or end a timer by itself. Not push. The sleep timer itself is unchanged when this is off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lokaler Banner und Vordergrund-Haptik, wenn der Schlaf-Timer die Wiedergabe pausiert oder stoppt — nur wenn iOS Banner erlaubt. Tippen auf den Banner öffnet keinen Bildschirm — nicht Posteingang, Downloads oder Einstellungen. Startet oder beendet keinen Timer von selbst. Kein Push. Der Schlaf-Timer selbst bleibt unverändert, wenn dies aus ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removes this error row, then enqueues the episode again via the normal manual download path. Manual download Wi‑Fi only, Parallel downloads, and storage limits still apply. A later failure adds a new log entry. Does not invent an episode or a separate retry queue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removes this error row, then enqueues the episode again via the normal manual download path. Manual download Wi‑Fi only, Parallel downloads, and storage limits still apply. A later failure adds a new log entry. Does not invent an episode or a separate retry queue."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entfernt diese Fehlerzeile und stellt die Episode danach erneut über den normalen manuellen Download-Pfad in die Warteschlange. Manueller Download nur Wi‑Fi, Parallele Downloads und Speicherlimits gelten weiter. Ein späterer Fehler fügt einen neuen Protokolleintrag hinzu. Erfindet keine Episode und keine separate Retry-Warteschlange."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fetches this podcast’s feed from the network, including when Keep updated is Never. Not Refresh all. Feed refresh is not limited by the Wi‑Fi-only toggles and may use cellular. Does not invent episodes; Auto-download may enqueue newly appeared ones after a successful refresh. Distinct from Rescan folder for local-folder podcasts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fetches this podcast’s feed from the network, including when Keep updated is Never. Not Refresh all. Feed refresh is not limited by the Wi‑Fi-only toggles and may use cellular. Does not invent episodes; Auto-download may enqueue newly appeared ones after a successful refresh. Distinct from Rescan folder for local-folder podcasts."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lädt den Feed dieses Podcasts aus dem Netzwerk, auch wenn Aktualisiert halten auf Nie steht. Nicht Alle aktualisieren. Feed-Aktualisierung wird von den Nur-Wi‑Fi-Schaltern nicht begrenzt und darf Mobilfunk nutzen. Erfindet keine Episoden; Automatischer Download kann nach erfolgreicher Aktualisierung neu erschienene einreihen. Unterschiedlich von Ordner neu scannen für lokale Ordner-Podcasts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Re-reads audio files in the folder via the saved bookmark. Does not fetch an RSS feed or invent network episodes. Distinct from Refresh for subscribed RSS podcasts. Does not change Keep updated or start Auto-download.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Re-reads audio files in the folder via the saved bookmark. Does not fetch an RSS feed or invent network episodes. Distinct from Refresh for subscribed RSS podcasts. Does not change Keep updated or start Auto-download."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Liest Audiodateien im Ordner über das gespeicherte Lesezeichen erneut. Holt keinen RSS-Feed und erfindet keine Netzwerk-Episoden. Unterschiedlich von Aktualisieren für abonnierte RSS-Podcasts. Ändert Aktualisiert halten nicht und startet keinen Automatischer Download."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refreshes every subscribed podcast that participates in Keep updated. Podcasts set to Keep updated Never are skipped; swipe Refresh on a row still refreshes that podcast alone. Uses the full subscriptions library, not search or filter. Feed refresh is not limited by the Wi‑Fi-only toggles and may use cellular. Does not invent episodes; Auto-download may enqueue newly appeared ones after successful refreshes. Distinct from Rescan folder.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refreshes every subscribed podcast that participates in Keep updated. Podcasts set to Keep updated Never are skipped; swipe Refresh on a row still refreshes that podcast alone. Uses the full subscriptions library, not search or filter. Feed refresh is not limited by the Wi‑Fi-only toggles and may use cellular. Does not invent episodes; Auto-download may enqueue newly appeared ones after successful refreshes. Distinct from Rescan folder."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktualisiert jeden abonnierten Podcast, der an Aktualisiert halten teilnimmt. Podcasts mit Aktualisiert halten Nie werden übersprungen; Wischen-Aktualisieren an einer Zeile aktualisiert diesen Podcast weiterhin allein. Nutzt die volle Abonnement-Bibliothek, nicht Suche oder Filter. Feed-Aktualisierung wird von den Nur-Wi‑Fi-Schaltern nicht begrenzt und darf Mobilfunk nutzen. Erfindet keine Episoden; Automatischer Download kann nach erfolgreichen Aktualisierungen neu erschienene einreihen. Unterschiedlich von Ordner neu scannen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local banners after a successful refresh may open Inbox for newly appeared episodes. Title is the podcast name, or New episode / New episodes when empty. Body is the episode title or a count. Per-podcast Off still silences that feed; per-podcast On is ignored while this is off. Does not post a banner by itself and does not download. Not push.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local banners after a successful refresh may open Inbox for newly appeared episodes. Title is the podcast name, or New episode / New episodes when empty. Body is the episode title or a count. Per-podcast Off still silences that feed; per-podcast On is ignored while this is off. Does not post a banner by itself and does not download. Not push."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lokale Banner nach erfolgreicher Aktualisierung können Posteingang für neu erschienene Episoden öffnen. Titel ist der Podcastname, oder Neue Episode / Neue Episoden wenn leer. Text ist der Episodentitel oder eine Anzahl. Pro-Podcast Aus stummelt diesen Feed weiterhin; Pro-Podcast An wird ignoriert, solange dieser Schalter aus ist. Löst selbst keinen Banner aus und lädt nicht herunter. Kein Push."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only newly appeared episode IDs after a successful refresh are candidates — not the unplayed backlog. Local-folder and file feeds are skipped. There is no separate Background App Refresh download. Wi‑Fi-only for auto-download is under Network / Downloads. Per-podcast Never skips that podcast; Always can still enqueue for that podcast while this global switch is off. Storage-limit eviction still applies. Manual downloads are unchanged.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only newly appeared episode IDs after a successful refresh are candidates — not the unplayed backlog. Local-folder and file feeds are skipped. There is no separate Background App Refresh download. Wi‑Fi-only for auto-download is under Network / Downloads. Per-podcast Never skips that podcast; Always can still enqueue for that podcast while this global switch is off. Storage-limit eviction still applies. Manual downloads are unchanged."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur neu erschienene Episoden-IDs nach erfolgreicher Aktualisierung sind Kandidaten — nicht der ungespielte Rückstand. Lokale Ordner- und Datei-Feeds werden übersprungen. Es gibt keinen separaten Background-App-Refresh-Download. Nur-Wi‑Fi für Auto-Download liegt unter Netzwerk / Downloads. Pro-Podcast Nie überspringt diesen Podcast; Immer kann für diesen Podcast weiterhin einreihen, während dieser globale Schalter aus ist. Speicherlimit-Bereinigung gilt weiterhin. Manuelle Downloads bleiben unverändert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filters completed downloads in this list by All, Unplayed, or Played. Does not delete files, change sort, start downloads, or alter the podcast filter chips. Search still applies on top of this filter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filters completed downloads in this list by All, Unplayed, or Played. Does not delete files, change sort, start downloads, or alter the podcast filter chips. Search still applies on top of this filter."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filtert abgeschlossene Downloads in dieser Liste nach Alle, Ungehört oder Gehört. Löscht keine Dateien, ändert die Sortierung nicht, startet keine Downloads und ändert die Podcast-Filterchips nicht. Suche gilt weiterhin zusätzlich zu diesem Filter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filters completed downloads in this list to All or one podcast that currently has downloads. Does not delete files, change sort, start downloads, or alter the All/Unplayed/Played status chips. Search still applies on top of this filter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filters completed downloads in this list to All or one podcast that currently has downloads. Does not delete files, change sort, start downloads, or alter the All/Unplayed/Played status chips. Search still applies on top of this filter."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filtert abgeschlossene Downloads in dieser Liste auf Alle oder einen Podcast, der derzeit Downloads hat. Löscht keine Dateien, ändert die Sortierung nicht, startet keine Downloads und ändert die Status-Chips Alle/Ungehört/Gehört nicht. Suche gilt weiterhin zusätzlich zu diesem Filter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filters the Queue by All, Unplayed, or Played. Does not remove queue items, change sort, start downloads, or alter the podcast filter chips. Search still applies on top of this filter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filters the Queue by All, Unplayed, or Played. Does not remove queue items, change sort, start downloads, or alter the podcast filter chips. Search still applies on top of this filter."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filtert die Warteschlange nach Alle, Ungehört oder Gehört. Entfernt keine Warteschlangen-Einträge, ändert die Sortierung nicht, startet keine Downloads und ändert die Podcast-Filterchips nicht. Suche gilt weiterhin zusätzlich zu diesem Filter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filters the Queue to All or one podcast that currently has queue items. Does not remove queue items, change sort, start downloads, or alter the All/Unplayed/Played status chips. Search still applies on top of this filter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filters the Queue to All or one podcast that currently has queue items. Does not remove queue items, change sort, start downloads, or alter the All/Unplayed/Played status chips. Search still applies on top of this filter."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filtert die Warteschlange auf Alle oder einen Podcast, der derzeit Einträge in der Warteschlange hat. Entfernt keine Warteschlangen-Einträge, ändert die Sortierung nicht, startet keine Downloads und ändert die Status-Chips Alle/Ungehört/Gehört nicht. Suche gilt weiterhin zusätzlich zu diesem Filter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filters the Inbox to All or one podcast that currently has inbox episodes. Does not mark played, delete episodes, change sort, or alter the episode type chips. Search still applies on top of this filter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filters the Inbox to All or one podcast that currently has inbox episodes. Does not mark played, delete episodes, change sort, or alter the episode type chips. Search still applies on top of this filter."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filtert den Posteingang auf Alle oder einen Podcast, der derzeit Posteingang-Episoden hat. Markiert nicht als gehört, löscht keine Episoden, ändert die Sortierung nicht und ändert die Episodentyp-Chips nicht. Suche gilt weiterhin zusätzlich zu diesem Filter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filters the Inbox by itunes episode type: All, Full, Trailer, Bonus, or Other when present. Does not mark played, delete episodes, change sort, or alter the podcast filter chips. Search still applies on top of this filter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filters the Inbox by itunes episode type: All, Full, Trailer, Bonus, or Other when present. Does not mark played, delete episodes, change sort, or alter the podcast filter chips. Search still applies on top of this filter."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filtert den Posteingang nach itunes-Episodentyp: Alle, Vollständig, Trailer, Bonus oder Sonstige, wenn vorhanden. Markiert nicht als gehört, löscht keine Episoden, ändert die Sortierung nicht und ändert die Podcast-Filterchips nicht. Suche gilt weiterhin zusätzlich zu diesem Filter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional override for feed refresh and downloads. Empty uses the app default. Newlines are removed. AVPlayer streaming may still use the system User-Agent. Does not enable HTTP proxy, restart active downloads, or change playback. See Effective User-Agent for the value in use.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional override for feed refresh and downloads. Empty uses the app default. Newlines are removed. AVPlayer streaming may still use the system User-Agent. Does not enable HTTP proxy, restart active downloads, or change playback. See Effective User-Agent for the value in use."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optionaler Override für Feed-Aktualisierung und Downloads. Leer = App-Standard. Zeilenumbrüche werden entfernt. AVPlayer-Streaming kann weiterhin die System-UA nutzen. Schaltet HTTP-Proxy nicht ein, startet aktive Downloads nicht neu und ändert die Wiedergabe nicht. Siehe Effektiver User-Agent für den verwendeten Wert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hostname without http or https. Empty host disables the proxy even when HTTP proxy is on. Used with Proxy port for URLSession clients. Does not test the connection, enable the toggle, or change Proxy password.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hostname without http or https. Empty host disables the proxy even when HTTP proxy is on. Used with Proxy port for URLSession clients. Does not test the connection, enable the toggle, or change Proxy password."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hostname ohne http oder https. Leerer Host deaktiviert den Proxy auch wenn HTTP-Proxy an ist. Wird mit Proxy-Port für URLSession-Clients genutzt. Testet die Verbindung nicht, schaltet den Schalter nicht ein und ändert Proxy-Passwort nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
